 • Compensation for accident death scheme in workplace is Rs 8 Lakh, other than workplace is Rs 5 Lakh in case of death Rs 2 Lakh in case of permanent total disablement and Rs 1 Lakh for permanent partial Disablement.', '["Medical Certificate", "Medical Disability Certificate", "Death Certificate", "FIR Copy", "Postmortem Report", "Self Declaration", "90 Days Work Certificate"]', '["Registered construction worker with accident during employment.", "Incident not caused by excluded reasons such as intoxication or self-harm.", "Application should be Submitted within one year from the Date of Accident Death"]', '[]', '["Ensure eligibility criteria are met.", "Collect required documents including medical and legal proofs.", "Submit the application via board software.", "Await verification and approval."]', NULL, NULL, 'https://sevasindhu.karnataka.gov.in/', true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', 'c1959caa-8b90-4d77-ac4e-621e337ae728', 'ಅಪಘಾತ ಪರಿಹಾರ', 'Accident means an event which is sudden without criminal intent and unforeseen resulting in death or incapacitation permanent total or partial disablement, assistance under this Rule shall be given by the Board excluding the following cases:
