d in the proposal."]', '["Applicant seeking approval for Single Plot LayoutPlanshall be the owner/GPA Holder of the land proposed for approval."]', '[]', '["No online service is available."]', NULL, NULL, NULL, true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', 'a766e78f-05f2-440a-8461-a06c5b738719', 'ಏಕ ನಿವೇಶನ ವಿನ್ಯಾಸ ಅನುಮೋದನೆ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ಏಕ ನಿವೇಶನ ವಸತಿ ಹಾಗೂ ಇತರೆ ಉದ್ದೇಶಕ್ಕಾಗಿ ವಿನ್ಯಾಸ ಅನುಮೋದನೆ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["ವಿನ್ಯಾಸ ಅನುಮೋದನೆಗಾಗಿ ಸಲ್ಲಿಸುವ ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರು ವಿನ್ಯಾಸ ಅನುಮೋದನೆಗಾಗಿ ಪ್ರಸ್ತಾಪಿಸಿರುವ ಜಮೀನಿನ ಮಾಲೀಕರು ಅಥವಾ ಜಿಪಿಎ ದಾರರು ಆಗಿರಬೇಕಾಗಿರುತ್ತದೆ."]', '["ಸದರಿ ಸೇವೆಯು ಆನ್ಲೈನ್ ನಲ್ಲಿ ಲಭ್ಯವಿರುವುದಿಲ್ಲ."]', 1, '["ಮಾಲಿಕತ್ವದ ದಾಖಲಾತಿಗಳು (ಕ್ರಯಪತ್ರ ಅಥವ ವಿಭಾಗಪತ್ರ ಅಥವ ಜಿಪಿಎ ಅಥವ ಇತರೆ)", "ಇತ್ತೀಚಿನ ಋಣಭಾರರಾಹಿತ್ಯ ಪ್ರಮಾಣಪತ್ (ಇ.ಸಿ.)", "ಇತ್ತೀಚಿನ ಪಹಣಿ (ಆರ್.ಟಿ.ಸಿ.),", "ಇತ್ತೀಚಿನ ಮ್ಯುಟೇಷನ್ ರಿಜಿಸ್ಟರ್ ಪ್ರತಿ (ಎಂ.ಆರ್.)", "ಆಕಾರ್ ಬಂದ್", "ಹಿಸ್ಸಾ ಮತ್ತು ಟಿಪ್ಪಣಿ", "ಭೂ ಪರಿವರ್ತನಾ ಆದೇಶದ ಪ್ರತಿಗಳು", "ಭೂ ದಾಖಲೆಗಳ ಸಹಾಯಕ ನಿರ್ದೇಶಕರು ದೃಢೀಕರಿಸಿದ ಸರ್ವೆ ನಕ್ಷೆ", "ಭೂ ದಾಖಲೆಗಳ ಸಹಾಯಕ ನಿರ್ದೇಶಕರು ದೃಢೀಕರಿಸಿದ ಸರ್ವೆ ನಕ್ಷೆಗೆ ಅನುಗುಣವಾಗಿ ವಲಯ ನಿಯಮಾವಳಿಗಳಂತೆ ತಯಾರಿಸಿರುವ ಕರಡು ಏಕ ನಿವೇಶನ ವಿನ್ಯಾಸ ನಕ್ಷೆ,", "ನೀರು ಸರಬರಾಜು ಸಂಬಂಧಪಟ್ಟ ಸ್ಥಳೀಯ ಸಂಸ್ಥೆಯಿಂದ ಪಡೆದ ನಿರಾಕ್ಷೇಪಣಾ ಪತ್ರ", "ಕರ್ನಾಟಕ ರಾಜ್ಯ ಮಾಲಿನ್ಯ ನಿಯಂತ್ರಣ ಮಂಡಳಿಯ ನಿರಾಕ್ಷೇಪಣಾ ಪತ್ರ (ವಸತಿಯೇತರ ಏಕ ನಿವೇಶನ ವಿನ್ಯಾಸ ನಕ್ಷೆ ಅನುಮೋದನೆಗೆ ಸಂಬಂಧಿಸಿದಂತೆ 10 ಎಕರೆ ವಿಸ್ತೀರ್ಣ ಮೇಲ್ಪಟ್ಟ ಪ್ರಸ್ತಾವನೆಗಳಿಗೆ),", "ಮಹಾಯೋಜನೆಯ ಉಧೃತ ಭಾಗ,", "ಗೂಗಲ್ ನಕ್ಷೆ", "ಗೂಗಲ್ ನಕ್ಷೆ", "ಸಲ್ಲಿಸಿರುವ ಎಲ್ಲಾ ದಾಖಲಾತಿಗಳು ಸರಿಯಾಗಿರುತ್ತವೆ ಎಂಬ ಬಗ್ಗೆ ರೂ.100 ಮುಖಬೆಲೆಯ ನೋಟರೀಕೃತ ಘೋಷಣಾಪತ್ರ", "ಪ್ರಸ್ತಾವನೆಯಲ್ಲಿರುವ ಜಮೀನುಗಳ ಸರ್ವೆ ನಂ.ಗಳ ಎಲ್ಲಾ ಭೂ ಮಾಲೀಕರ ಸಹಿಯೊಂದಿಗೆ ಆಧಾರ್ ಕಾರ್ಡ್ ಪ್ರತಿ", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಅಧಾರ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('02056360-c03f-4cc4-94ef-2f933432903c', 'SOCIAL-WELFARE-DEPAR-12', '81b60538-519f-4131-bd38-c390f2d882d6', 'Dr. Babu Jagjeevan Ram Two Wheeler Cargo Transport Scheme', 'Loan with Subsidy', 0, 'In 2022-23, a scheme will be implemented to promote self-employment and increase self-confidence among Scheduled Castes and Scheduled Tribes youth. This scheme is designed to facilitate e-commerce businesses and create employment in other services. Under this scheme, beneficiaries who purchase electric or other two-wheeler/three-wheeler goods transport vehicles will receive a subsidy of Rs. 50,000 and a loan of Rs. 20,000.', '["Applicant Aadhar Card (Mandatory)", "Applicant Photo (Mandatory)", "Applicant Voter ID (Mandatory)", "Applicant Ration Card (Mandatory)", "Caste & Income Certificate issued by competent authority (Mandatory)", "Must Possess Relevant Vehicle Driving License (Mandatory)", "Must Possess Relevant Vehicle Quotation (Mandatory)", "In E-Commerce, submit proof of employment or a self-affidavit for selling goods (Mandatory)", "Submission of certificate attested by The Disability Welfare Officer is required in disability cases (Optional)", "The applicant must declare they have not received prior assistance from the Corporation (Optional)"]', '["Applicant should be resident of Karnataka state.", "Applicant should belong to a Scheduled Caste.", "The applicant''s family annual income should not exceed Rs 1.5 lakh for rural areas and Rs 2.00 lakh for urban area.", "Applicant Age should be between 21 to 60 years.", "The applicant or their family should not have availed any benefits or facilities from the Corporation previously.", "Submission of certificate attested by The Disability Welfare Officer is required in disability cases."]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, 'https://sevasindhuservices.karnataka.gov.in/', true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', 'b50adf7f-fb5f-444f-bdef-63731a6a9b80', 'ಡಾ. ಬಾಬು ಜಗಜೀವನ ರಾಂ ದ್ವಿಚಕ್ರ ವಾಹನ ಸರಕು ಸಾಗಾಣಿಕೆ ಯೋಜನೆ', 'Two Wheeler Cargo Transport Scheme', NULL, NULL, 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2022-23 ನೇ ಸಾಲಿನಲ್ಲಿ ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿ ಮತ್ತು ವರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಪಂಗಡದ ಯುವಕರಲ್ಲಿ ಸ್ವಯಂ ಉದ್ಯೋಗವನ್ನು ಉತ್ತೇಜಿಸಲು ಮತ್ತು ಆತ್ಮವಿಶ್ವಾಸವನ್ನು ಹೆಚ್ಚಿಸಲು , ಇ-ಕಾಮರ್ಸ್ ವ್ಯವಹಾರಗಳನ್ನು ಸುಲಭಗೊಳಿಸಲು ಮತ್ತು ಇತರ ಸೇವೆಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಉದ್ಯೋಗವನ್ನು ಸೃಷ್ಟಿಸಲು ಈ ಯೋಜನೆಯನ್ನು ವಿನ್ಯಾಸಗೊಳಿಸಲಾಗಿದೆ. ಈ ಯೋಜನೆಯಡಿಯಲ್ಲಿ, ವಿದ್ಯುತ್ ಅಥವಾ ಇತರೆ ಎರಡು/ಮೂರು ಚಕ್ರದ ಸರಕು ಸಾಗಣೆ ವಾಹನಗಳನ್ನು ಖರೀದಿಸುವ ಫಲಾನುಭವಿಗಳಿಗೆ ರೂ. 50,000 ಸಹಾಯಧನ ಹಾಗೂ ರೂ. 20,000 ಸಾಲವನ್ನು ನೀಡಲಾಗುತ್ತದೆ.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["ಕರ್ನಾಟಕ ರಾಜ್ಯದ ನಿವಾಸಿಯಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರು ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿ ಸಮುದಾಯಕ್ಕೆ ಸೇರಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ವಾರ್ಷಿಕ ಆದಾಯ ಗ್ರಾಮೀಣ ಭಾಗಕ್ಕೆ ರೂ 1.5 ಲಕ್ಷ ಹಾಗೂ ನಗರ ಪ್ರದೇಶದಲ್ಲಿರುವವರಿಗೆ ರೂ 2.00 ಲಕ್ಷ ಮೀರಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ವಯಸ್ಸು 21 ರಿಂದ 60 ವರ್ಷದೊಳಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಅಥವಾ ಅವರ ಕುಟುಂಬದವರು ಈ ಹಿಂದೆ ನಿಗಮದಿಂದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸೌಲಭ್ಯ ಪಡೆದಿರಬಾರದು.", "ವಿಕಲಚೇತನರಾಗಿದ್ದಲ್ಲಿ ಜಿಲ್ಲಾ ಅಂಗವಿಕಲ ಕಲ್ಯಾಣಾಧಿಕಾರಿಗಳಿಂದ ದೃಢೀಕರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟ ಪ್ರಮಾಣ ಪತ್ರ ಸಲ್ಲಿಸುವುದು."]', '[]', 1, '["ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಆಧಾರ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('f351cfbe-e8ed-4b2d-a4a8-464c3f602ec3', 'SOCIAL-WELFARE-DEPAR-11', '81b60538-519f-4131-bd38-c390f2d882d6', 'Swavalambi Sarathi Scheme', 'Subsidy', 0, 'Under Swalambi Sarathi Yojana, the scheme will be implemented in collaboration with banks by sanctioning 75% subsidy or maximum Rs.4.00 lakhs for goods transport/taxi (yellow board) vehicles.', '["Applicant Aadhar Cards (Mandatory)", "Applicant Ration Card (Mandatory)", "Applicant Voter ID (Mandatory)", "Caste & Income Certificate issued by competent authority (Mandatory)", "Vehicle Quotation (Mandatory)", "The applicant must declare they have not received prior assistance from the Corporation (Mandatory)", "Applicant Photo (Mandatory)", "Bank Pass Book (with Cover Page) (Mandatory)", "Vehicle Driving License(DL) (Mandatory)"]', '["Applicant should be resident of Karnataka state.", "Applicant should belong to a Scheduled Caste.", "Applicant Age should be between 21 to 56 years.", "None of the applicant''s family members should be employed in a government or semi-government position.", "The applicant or their family should not have availed any benefits or facilities from the Corporation previously.", "The applicant''s family annual income should not exceed Rs 1.5 lakh for rural areas and Rs 2.00 lakh for urban area."]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, 'https://sevasindhuservices.karnataka.gov.in/', true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', 'b50adf7f-fb5f-444f-bdef-63731a6a9b80', 'ಸ್ವಾವಲಂಬಿ ಸಾರಥಿ ಯೋಜನೆ', 'Swavalambi Sarathi /ISB 3.5', NULL, NULL, 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ಸ್ವಾವಲಂಬಿ ಸಾರಥಿ ಯೋಜನೆಯಡಿ ಸರಕು ಸಾಗಾಣಿಕೆ/ಟ್ಯಾಕ್ಸಿ (ಹಳದಿ ಬೋರ್ಡ್) ವಾಹನಗಳಿಗೆ ಘಟಕ ವೆಚ್ಚದ ಶೇ.75ರಷ್ಟು ಅಥವಾ ಗರಿಷ್ಟ ರೂ.4.00 ಲಕ್ಷಗಳವರೆಗೆ ಸಹಾಯಧನವನ್ನು ಮಂಜೂರು ಮಾಡಿ ಬ್ಯಾಂಕ್', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["ಕರ್ನಾಟಕ ರಾಜ್ಯದ ನಿವಾಸಿಯಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿ ಸಮುದಾಯಕ್ಕೆ ಸೇರಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ವಯಸ್ಸು 21 ರಿಂದ 56 ವರ್ಷದೊಳಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸದಸ್ಯರು, ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ/ಅರೆ ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ ಸಂಸ್ಥೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಉದ್ಯೋಗಿಯಾಗಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಅಥವಾ ಅವರ ಕುಟುಂಬದವರು ಈ ಹಿಂದೆ ನಿಗಮದಿಂದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸೌಲಭ್ಯ ಪಡೆದಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ವಾರ್ಷಿಕ ಆದಾಯ ಗ್ರಾಮೀಣ ಭಾಗಕ್ಕೆ ರೂ 1.5 ಲಕ್ಷ ಹಾಗೂ ನಗರ ಪ್ರದೇಶದಲ್ಲಿರುವವರಿಗೆ ರೂ 2.00 ಲಕ್ಷ ಮೀರಿರಬಾರದು."]', '[]', 1, '["ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಆಧಾರ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('0a2f7dff-8b0e-4392-bdd8-6d2ad3ccc9cf', 'SOCIAL-WELFARE-DEPAR-10', '81b60538-519f-4131-bd38-c390f2d882d6', 'Micro Credit Prerana Scheme 5 Lakh', 'Loan with Subsidy', 0, 'Loans and grants will be extended to support various economic activities undertaken by Self-Help Groups of Scheduled Caste women. Each female member will receive Rs. 25,000, comprising a subsidy of Rs. 15,000 and a loan of Rs. 10,000. Self-help groups with a minimum of 10 women members and a unit cost of Rs. 2.50 lakhs will be eligible for loan assistance as per regulations. The loan must be repaid to the Corporation in 36 equal installments with a 4% interest rate', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, 'https://sevasindhuservices.karnataka.gov.in/', true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', 'b50adf7f-fb5f-444f-bdef-63731a6a9b80', 'ಪ್ರೇರಣಾ (ಮೈಕ್ರೋ ಕ್ರೆಡಿಟ್) ಯೋಜನೆ 5 ಲಕ್ಷ', 'Prerana (Micro Credit) 5 Lakh', NULL, NULL, 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿ ಸಮುದಾಯದ ಮಹಿಳಾ ಸ್ವಸಹಾಯ ಸಂಘಗಳ ವಿವಿಧ ಉದ್ದೇಶದ ಆರ್ಥಿಕ ಚಟುವಟಿಕೆಗಳಿಗೆ ಸಾಲ ಮತ್ತು ಸಹಾಯಧನ ನೀಡಲಾಗುವುದು. ಪ್ರತಿ ಮಹಿಳಾ ಸದಸ್ಯರಿಗೆ ರೂ 25000. ಇದರಲ್ಲಿ ಸಹಾಯಧನ ರೂ15000 ಹಾಗೂ ಸಾಲ ರೂ10000 ಗಳಾಗಿರುತ್ತದೆ. ಕನಿಷ್ಠ 10 ಜನ ಮಹಿಳಾ ಸದಸ್ಯರು ಇರುವ ಸ್ವ-ಸಹಾಯ ಗುಂಪಿಗೆ ಘಟಕ ವೆಚ್ಛ ರೂ 2.50 ಲಕ್ಷಗಳಂತೆ ನಿಯಮಾನುಸಾರ ಅರ್ಹರಿರುವ ಗುಂಪಿಗೆ ಸಾಲ ಸೌಲಭ್ಯ ಒದಗಿಸಲಾಗುವುದು. ಸದರಿ ಸಾಲದ ಹಣವನ್ನು 36 ಸಮ ಕಂತುಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಶೇ 4 ರ ಬಡ್ಡಿ ದರದಲ್ಲಿ ನಿಗಮಕ್ಕೆ ಮರುಪಾವತಿ ಮಾಡ ಬೇಕಾಗಿರುತ್ತದೆ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '[]', 1, '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('d76f63c9-2ff5-4b20-8c22-f5b58d7b64c1', 'SOCIAL-WELFARE-DEPAR-9', '81b60538-519f-4131-bd38-c390f2d882d6', 'Micro Credit Prerana Scheme', 'Loan with Subsidy', 0, 'Loans and grants will be extended to support various economic activities undertaken by Self-Help Groups of Scheduled Caste women. Each female member will receive Rs. 25,000, comprising a subsidy of Rs. 15,000 and a loan of Rs. 10,000. Self-help groups with a minimum of 10 women members and a unit cost of Rs. 2.50 lakhs will be eligible for loan assistance as per regulations. The loan must be repaid to the Corporation in 36 equal installments with a 4% interest rate', '["Applicant''s Aadhar Cards (Mandatory)", "Applicant''s Ration Card (Mandatory)", "Applicant''s Voter ID (Mandatory)", "Caste & Income Certificate issued by competent authority (Mandatory)", "The applicant must declare they have not received prior assistance from the Corporation (Mandatory)", "Applicant''s Photo (Mandatory)", "Bank Pass Book (with Cover Page) (Mandatory)", "Should Have Valid Association Registration Copy (Mandatory)", "Copy of at least 3 months'' worth of recent association meeting minutes (Mandatory)"]', '["Applicant should be resident of Karnataka state.", "Applicant should belong to a Scheduled Caste.", "Applicant Age should be between 21 to 60 years.", "None of the applicant''s family members should be employed in a government or semi-government position.", "The applicant or their family should not have availed any benefits or facilities from the Corporation previously.", "The applicant''s family annual income should not exceed Rs 1.5 lakh for rural areas and Rs 2.00 lakh for urban area.", "Submission of a certificate attested by the District Disability Welfare Officer is required in case of disability.", "Registered Copy of Self Help Group.", "Out of the 60% Scheduled Caste members of the association, 40% of the members should belong to the sub-castes belonging to the corporation.", "Members of the SHG should have ration card."]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, 'https://sevasindhuservices.karnataka.gov.in/', true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', 'b50adf7f-fb5f-444f-bdef-63731a6a9b80', 'ಪ್ರೇರಣಾ (ಮೈಕ್ರೋ ಕ್ರೆಡಿಟ್) ಯೋಜನೆ', 'Prerana (Micro Credit)', NULL, NULL, 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿ ಸಮುದಾಯದ ಮಹಿಳಾ ಸ್ವಸಹಾಯ ಸಂಘಗಳ ವಿವಿಧ ಉದ್ದೇಶದ ಆರ್ಥಿಕ ಚಟುವಟಿಕೆಗಳಿಗೆ ಸಾಲ ಮತ್ತು ಸಹಾಯಧನ ನೀಡಲಾಗುವುದು. ಪ್ರತಿ ಮಹಿಳಾ ಸದಸ್ಯರಿಗೆ ರೂ.25000. ಇದರಲ್ಲಿ ಸಹಾಯಧನ ರೂ.15000 ಹಾಗೂ ಸಾಲ ರೂ.10000 ಗಳಾಗಿರುತ್ತದೆ. ಕನಿಷ್ಠ 10 ಜನ ಮಹಿಳಾ ಸದಸ್ಯರು ಇರುವ ಸ್ವ-ಸಹಾಯ ಗುಂಪಿಗೆ ಘಟಕ ವೆಚ್ಛ ರೂ. 2.50 ಲಕ್ಷಗಳಂತೆ ನಿಯಮಾನುಸಾರ ಅರ್ಹರಿರುವ ಗುಂಪಿಗೆ ಸಾಲ ಸೌಲಭ್ಯ ಒದಗಿಸಲಾಗುವುದು. ಸದರಿ ಸಾಲದ ಹಣವನ್ನು 36 ಸಮ ಕಂತುಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಶೇ 4 ರ ಬಡ್ಡಿ ದರದಲ್ಲಿ ನಿಗಮಕ್ಕೆ ಮರುಪಾವತಿ ಮಾಡಬೇಕಾಗಿರುತ್ತದೆ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["ಕರ್ನಾಟಕ ರಾಜ್ಯದ ನಿವಾಸಿಯಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿ ಸಮುದಾಯಕ್ಕೆ ಸೇರಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ವಯಸ್ಸು 21 ರಿಂದ 60 ವರ್ಷದೊಳಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸದಸ್ಯರು, ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ/ಅರೆ ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ ಸಂಸ್ಥೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಉದ್ಯೋಗಿಯಾಗಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಅಥವಾ ಅವರ ಕುಟುಂಬದವರು ಈ ಹಿಂದೆ ನಿಗಮದಿಂದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸೌಲಭ್ಯ ಪಡೆದಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ವಾರ್ಷಿಕ ಆದಾಯ ಗ್ರಾಮೀಣ ಭಾಗಕ್ಕೆ ರೂ 1.5 ಲಕ್ಷ ಹಾಗೂ ನಗರ ಪ್ರದೇಶದಲ್ಲಿರುವವರಿಗೆ ರೂ 2.00 ಲಕ್ಷ ಮೀರಿರಬಾರದು.", "ವಿಕಲಚೇತನರಾಗಿದ್ದಲ್ಲಿ ಜಿಲ್ಲಾ ಅಂಗವಿಕಲ ಕಲ್ಯಾಣಾಧಿಕಾರಿಗಳಿಂದ ದೃಢೀಕರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟ ಪ್ರಮಾಣ ಪತ್ರ ಸಲ್ಲಿಸುವುದು.", "ಚಾಲ್ತಿಯಲ್ಲಿರುವ ಸಂಘದ ನೊಂದಣಿ ಪತ್ರ.", "ಸಂಘದ ಶೇ 60 ರ ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿಯ ಸದಸ್ಯರುಗಳ ಪೈಕಿ ಶೇ 40 ರಷ್ಟು ಸದಸ್ಯರು ನಿಗಮಕ್ಕೆ ಸೇರಿದ ಉಪ ಜಾತಿಯವರಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಸಂಘದ ಸದಸ್ಯರು ಪಡಿತರ ಚೀಟಿಯನ್ನು ಹೊಂದಿರಬೇಕು."]', '[]', 1, '["ಎಲ್ಲಾ ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಆಧಾರ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('da65b5f8-7a71-4fe6-8164-a2c8d058fdaf', 'SOCIAL-WELFARE-DEPAR-8', '81b60538-519f-4131-bd38-c390f2d882d6', 'Self Employment Direct Loan Scheme', 'Loan with Subsidy', 0, 'Scheduled caste individuals can engage in small-scale economic activities such as selling fruits, vegetables, fish, and rearing livestock like cows, sheep, pigs, or rabbits. The unit cost for these endeavors is Rs.1.00 lakh, with financial support comprising a Rs.50,000 subsidy and a Rs.50,000 loan. Beneficiaries are required to repay the loan to the corporation in 36 equal installments, with an interest rate of 4%.', '["Applicant Aadhar Card (Optional)", "Ration card (Optional)", "Aadhar linked PassBook Front Page Photo (Optional)", "Caste & Income Certificate issued by competent authority (Optional)", "The applicant must declare they have not received prior assistance from the Corporation (Optional)", "Passport size Photo (Optional)", "Submission of certificate attested by The Disability Welfare Officer is required in disability cases (Optional)", "Project Report / Quotation (Optional)"]', '["Applicant should be resident of Karnataka state.", "Applicant should belong to a Scheduled Caste.", "Applicant Age should be between 21 to 60 years.", "None of the applicant''s family members should be employed in a government or semi-government position.", "The applicant or their family should not have availed any benefits or facilities from the Corporation previously.", "The applicant''s family annual income should not exceed Rs 1.5 lakh for rural areas and Rs 2.00 lakh for urban area.", "Submission of a certificate attested by the District Disability Welfare Officer is required in case of disability."]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, 'https://sevasindhuservices.karnataka.gov.in/', true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', 'b50adf7f-fb5f-444f-bdef-63731a6a9b80', 'ಸ್ವಯಂ ಉದ್ಯೋಗ (ನೇರಸಾಲ) ಯೋಜನೆ', 'Self Employment Scheme', NULL, NULL, 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿ ನಿರುದ್ಯೋಗಿಗಳಿಗೆ ಹಣ್ಣು,, ತರಕಾರಿ, ಮೀನು, ಮಾಂಸ ಮಾರಾಟ, ಹಸು/ಕುರಿ/ಹಂದಿ/ಮೊಲ ಸಾಕಾಣಿಕೆ ಇತ್ಯಾದಿ ಕಿರು ಆರ್ಥಿಕ ಚಟುವಟಿಕೆಗಳಿಗೆ ಘಟಕ ವೆಚ್ಚ ರೂ.1.00ಲಕ್ಷಗಳಾಗಿದ್ದು, ಈ ಪೈಕಿ ರೂ.50,000/- ಸಹಾಯಧನ ಹಾಗೂ ರೂ.50,000/- ಸಾಲದ ರೂಪದಲ್ಲಿ ಆರ್ಥಿಕ ನೆರವನ್ನು ಕಲ್ಪಿಸಲಾಗುತ್ತಿದೆ. ಸಾಲದ ಮೊತ್ತವನ್ನು 36 ಸಮಾನ ಕಂತುಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ನಿಗಮಕ್ಕೆ ಶೇ.4ರ ಬಡ್ಡಿದರದೊಂದಿಗೆ ಮರುಪಾವತಿಸಬೇಕಾಗಿರುತ್ತದೆ.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["ಕರ್ನಾಟಕ ರಾಜ್ಯದ ನಿವಾಸಿಯಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿ ಸಮುದಾಯಕ್ಕೆ ಸೇರಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ವಯಸ್ಸು 21 ರಿಂದ 60 ವರ್ಷದೊಳಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸದಸ್ಯರು, ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ/ಅರೆ ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ ಸಂಸ್ಥೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಉದ್ಯೋಗಿಯಾಗಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಅಥವಾ ಅವರ ಕುಟುಂಬದವರು ಈ ಹಿಂದೆ ನಿಗಮದಿಂದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸೌಲಭ್ಯ ಪಡೆದಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ವಾರ್ಷಿಕ ಆದಾಯ ಗ್ರಾಮೀಣ ಭಾಗಕ್ಕೆ ರೂ 1.5 ಲಕ್ಷ ಹಾಗೂ ನಗರ ಪ್ರದೇಶದಲ್ಲಿರುವವರಿಗೆ ರೂ 2.00 ಲಕ್ಷ ಮೀರಿರಬಾರದು.", "ವಿಕಲಚೇತನರಾಗಿದ್ದಲ್ಲಿ ಜಿಲ್ಲಾ ಅಂಗವಿಕಲ ಕಲ್ಯಾಣಾಧಿಕಾರಿಗಳಿಂದ ದೃಢೀಕರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟ ಪ್ರಮಾಣ ಪತ್ರ ಸಲ್ಲಿಸುವುದು."]', '[]', 1, '["ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಆಧಾರ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('d74556d7-c4a9-4358-982d-b7e4288c551c', 'SOCIAL-WELFARE-DEPAR-7', '81b60538-519f-4131-bd38-c390f2d882d6', 'ISB - Fast Food Truck Trailer/Mobile Food Kitchen - Rs. 4.00 Lakhs', 'Subsidy', 0, 'Under the ISB (Industrial Service Business) scheme, this fully subsidized Fast Food Truck Trailer/Mobile Kitchen is a mobile food service unit worth ₹4.00 lakhs.', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, 'https://sevasindhuservices.karnataka.gov.in/', true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', 'b50adf7f-fb5f-444f-bdef-63731a6a9b80', 'ಐಎಸ್ಬಿ - ಫಾಸ್ಟ್ ಫುಡ್ ಟ್ರಕ್ ಟ್ರೇಲರ್/ಮೊಬೈಲ್ ಫುಡ್ ಕಿಚನ್ - ₹4.00 ಲಕ್ಷಗಳು', 'Fast Food Truck Trailer/Mobile Food Kitchen - 4 Lakh', NULL, NULL, 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ಐಎಸ್ಬಿ (ಉದ್ಯಮ ಶೀಲತಾ ಅಭಿವೃದ್ದಿ ಯೋಜನೆ) ಯೋಜನೆಯ ಅಡಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಸಂಪೂರ್ಣ ಸಹಾಯಧನದೊಂದಿಗೆ ನೀಡಲಾಗುವ ಈ ಫಾಸ್ಟ್ ಫುಡ್ ಟ್ರಕ್ ಟ್ರೇಲರ್/ಮೊಬೈಲ್ ಕಿಚನ್ ₹4.00 ಲಕ್ಷ ಮೌಲ್ಯದ ಚಲಿಸುವ ಆಹಾರ ಸೇವಾ ಘಟಕವಾಗಿದೆ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '[]', 1, '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('d13ae31b-5047-46ca-a163-98fb299f523f', 'SOCIAL-WELFARE-DEPAR-6', '81b60538-519f-4131-bd38-c390f2d882d6', 'Land Purchase scheme', 'Loan with Subsidy', 0, 'Under the Land-Ownership Scheme, land will be purchased from non-Scheduled Caste/Scheduled Tribe landowners. Landless women agricultural labourers belonging to the Scheduled Caste community will receive Rs. 20 lakh for 27 districts and Rs. 25 lakh for 4 districts (Bangalore City, Bangalore Rural, Chikkaballapur, and Ramanagara), with 50% subsidy and 50% loan. Khushki/Tari/Bagaitu land within a maximum distance of 10 km from the beneficiary''s residence will be provided. The loan must be repaid to the Corporation in 10 annual equal installments at an interest rate of 6% per annum.', '["Beneficiary Aadhaar Card As Residential Proof (Mandatory)", "Beneficiary Caste Certificate Issued by the competent authority (Mandatory)", "Beneficiary Income Certificate Issued by the competent authority (Mandatory)", "Letter of Landless Agricultural labourers (from Tahsildar) (Mandatory)", "Beneficiary Ration Card (Mandatory)", "Land Owners Cover letter for sale of land (To be notarized and submitted on Stamp paper.) (Mandatory)", "land owner Family Tree (To be verified and submitted by village accountants.) (Mandatory)", "Letter of No Objection (NOC) from Family Members (should be notarized and submitted.) (Mandatory)", "Latest pahani and mutation copy (Mandatory)", "Land Owners Last 13 years E.C. (Encumbrance Certificate should be submitted.) (Mandatory)", "Beneficiary Photo (Mandatory)"]', '["Applicants must belong to scheduled castes and its related community.", "The applicant must be a land less agriculture labour family.", "Self-declaration certificate must be submitted in case of caste certificate.", "Should be resident of Karnataka state.", "The applicant and no member of his family should not be in employment in any Govt./Semi Govt organization.", "The beneficiaries eligible to avail of facilities under the land ownership scheme must be landless women agricultural laborers.", "Additionally, the landowners selling the land should not belong to Scheduled Castes and Scheduled Tribes.", "The land to be purchased is a maximum of 10 km from the place where the beneficiary lives. m. should be within range."]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, 'https://sevasindhuservices.karnataka.gov.in/', true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', 'b50adf7f-fb5f-444f-bdef-63731a6a9b80', 'ಭೂ-ಒಡೆತನ ಯೋಜನೆ', 'Land Purchase scheme', NULL, NULL, 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ಭೂ -ಒಡೆತನ ಯೋಜನೆಯಡಿ ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿ / ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಪಂಗಡಕ್ಕೆ ಸೇರದ ಭೂ ಮಾಲೀಕರಿಂದ ಜಮೀನನ್ನು ಖರೀದಿಸಿ, ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿಯ ಸಮುದಾಯದ ಭೂ ರಹಿತ ಮಹಿಳಾ ಕೃಷಿ ಕಾರ್ಮಿಕರಿಗೆ 27 ಜಿಲ್ಲೆಗಳಿಗೆ ರೂ 20 ಲಕ್ಷ ಮತ್ತು 4 ಜಿಲ್ಲೆಗಳಿಗೆ (ಬೆಂಗಳೂರು ನಗರ, ಬೆಂಗಳೂರು ಗ್ರಾಮಾಂತರ, ಚಿಕ್ಕಬಳ್ಳಾಪುರ ಮತ್ತು ರಾಮನಗರ) ರೂ 25 ಲಕ್ಷಗಳಿಗೆ (ಸಹಾಯಧನ ಶೇ 50 ಮತ್ತು ಸಾಲ ಶೇ 50 ರಷ್ಟು) ಖುಷ್ಕಿ/ತರಿ/ಬಾಗಾಯ್ತು ಜಮೀನನ್ನು ಫಲಾನುಭವಿಯು ವಾಸಿಸುತ್ತಿರುವ ಸ್ಥಳದಿಂದ ಗರಿಷ್ಠ 10 ಕಿ. ಮೀ. ವ್ಯಾಪ್ತಿಯೊಳಗೆ ಖರೀದಿಸಿ, ಭೂರಹಿತ ಮಹಿಳಾ ಕೃಷಿ ಕಾರ್ಮಿಕರಿಗೆ ಒದಗಿಸಲಾಗುವುದು ಮತ್ತು ಸಾಲದ ಮೊತ್ತವನ್ನು 10 ವಾರ್ಷಿಕ ಸಮ ಕಂತುಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ವಾರ್ಷಿಕ ಶೇ 6 ರ ಬಡ್ಡಿ ದರದಲ್ಲಿ ನಿಗಮಕ್ಕೆ ಮರುಪಾವತಿ ಮಾಡ ಬೇಕಾಗಿರುತ್ತದೆ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರು ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿಯ ಸಂಬಂಧಿತ ಜಾತಿಗಳಿಗೆ ಸೇರಿದವರಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರು ಭೂ ರಹಿತ ಕೃಷಿ ಕಾರ್ಮಿಕ ಕುಟುಂಬದವರಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಜಾತಿ ಪ್ರಮಾಣ ಪತ್ರವನ್ನು ಸಲ್ಲಿಸಿದಲ್ಲಿ ಕಡ್ಡಾಯವಾಗಿ ಸ್ವಯಂ ಘೋಷಣೆ ಪ್ರಮಾಣ ಪತ್ರವನ್ನು ಸಲ್ಲಿಸಬೇಕು.", "ಕರ್ನಾಟಕ ರಾಜ್ಯದ ನಿವಾಸಿಯಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರು/ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ಅವಲಂಬಿತ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸದಸ್ಯರು ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ/ಅರೆ ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ ನೌಕರಿಯಲ್ಲಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಭೂಒಡೆತನ ಯೋಜನೆಯಡಿ ಸೌಲಭ್ಯ ಪಡೆಯಲು ಫಲಾಪೇಕ್ಷಿಯು ಭೂರಹಿತ ಮಹಿಳಾ ಕೃಷಿ ಕಾರ್ಮಿಕರಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಜಮೀನು ಮಾರಾಟ ಮಾಡುವ ಭೂಮಾಲೀಕರು ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟಜಾತಿ ಮತ್ತು ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಪಂಗಡಕ್ಕೆ ಸೇರಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಖರೀದಿಸುವ ಜಮೀನು ಫಲಾನುಭವಿಯು ವಾಸಿಸುತ್ತಿರುವ ಸ್ಥಳದಿಂದ ಗರಿಷ್ಠ 10 ಕಿ. ಮೀ. ವ್ಯಾಪ್ತಿಯೊಳಗೆ ಇರಬೇಕು."]', '[]', 1, '["ಫಲಾನುಭವಿಯ ಆಧಾರ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('e9ff0130-b02e-4427-ae82-863b087e73b1', 'SOCIAL-WELFARE-DEPAR-5', '81b60538-519f-4131-bd38-c390f2d882d6', 'Sheep/Goat Farming Scheme', 'Loan with Subsidy', 0, 'Under the Sheep Farming Scheme, beneficiaries receive a loan of ₹50,000 along with a subsidy of ₹50,000 to support sustainable sheep rearing and income generation', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, 'https://sevasindhuservices.karnataka.gov.in/', true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', 'b50adf7f-fb5f-444f-bdef-63731a6a9b80', 'ಕುರಿ/ಮೇಖೆ ಸಾಕಾಣಿಕೆ ಯೋಜನೆ', 'Sheep/Goat Farming Scheme', NULL, NULL, 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ಈ ಯೋಜನೆಯ ಅಡಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಫಲಾನುಭವಿಗಳಿಗೆ ₹50,000 ರ ঋಣ ಮತ್ತು ₹50,000 ರ ಸಹಾಯಧನವನ್ನು ಒದಗಿಸಲಾಗುತ್ತದೆ, ಇದು ಸ್ಥಿರ ಕುರಿ ಸಾಕಾಣಿಕೆ ಮತ್ತು ಆದಾಯ ಉತ್ಪಾದನೆಗೆ ನೆರವಾಗುತ್ತದೆ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '[]', 1, '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('c7a5688f-43e2-43a8-96ab-4449141278fb', 'SOCIAL-WELFARE-DEPAR-4', '81b60538-519f-4131-bd38-c390f2d882d6', 'Industrial Service Business - ISB (in association with Bank) Maximum Rs. 2 lakh subsidy', 'Subsidy', 0, 'Industrial Service Business (in collaboration with the Bank) development scheme, assistance from the Corporation to start self-employment units for unemployed youths and women of the Scheduled Caste community in small scale industry, service sector and business sectors and the rest is loan from the bank. Subsidy of 70% of the unit cost or a maximum of Rs 2 lakh', '["Applicant''s Aadhar Cards (Optional)", "Ration Card (Mandatory)", "Aadhar linked PassBook Front Page Photo (Mandatory)", "Caste & Income Certificate issued by competent authority (Optional)", "Project Report / Quotation (Optional)", "The applicant must declare they have not received prior assistance from the Corporation (Optional)", "Applicant Photo (Mandatory)", "Submission of certificate attested by The Disability Welfare Officer is required in disability cases (Optional)"]', '["Applicant should be resident of Karnataka state.", "Applicant should belong to a Scheduled Caste.", "Applicant Age should be between 21 to 56 years.", "None of the applicant''s family members should be employed in a government or semi-government position.", "The applicant or their family should not have availed any benefits or facilities from the Corporation previously.", "The applicant''s family annual income should not exceed Rs 1.5 lakh for rural areas and Rs 2.00 lakh for urban area.", "Submission of a certificate attested by the District Disability Welfare Officer is required in case of disability."]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, 'https://sevasindhuservices.karnataka.gov.in/', true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', 'b50adf7f-fb5f-444f-bdef-63731a6a9b80', 'ಉದ್ಯಮ ಶೀಲತಾ ಅಭಿವೃದ್ದಿ ಯೋಜನೆ -ಐ.ಎಸ್.ಬಿ (ಬ್ಯಾಂಕ್', 'Industrial Service Business 2.0', NULL, NULL, 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ಉದ್ಯಮ ಶೀಲತಾ ಅಭಿವೃದ್ದಿ ಯೋಜನೆ -ಐ.ಎಸ್.ಬಿ (ಬ್ಯಾಂಕ್', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["ಕರ್ನಾಟಕ ರಾಜ್ಯದ ನಿವಾಸಿಯಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿ ಸಮುದಾಯಕ್ಕೆ ಸೇರಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ವಯಸ್ಸು 21 ರಿಂದ 56 ವರ್ಷದೊಳಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸದಸ್ಯರು, ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ/ಅರೆ ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ ಸಂಸ್ಥೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಉದ್ಯೋಗಿಯಾಗಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಅಥವಾ ಅವರ ಕುಟುಂಬದವರು ಈ ಹಿಂದೆ ನಿಗಮದಿಂದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸೌಲಭ್ಯ ಪಡೆದಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ವಾರ್ಷಿಕ ಆದಾಯ ಗ್ರಾಮೀಣ ಭಾಗಕ್ಕೆ ರೂ 1.5 ಲಕ್ಷ ಹಾಗೂ ನಗರ ಪ್ರದೇಶದಲ್ಲಿರುವವರಿಗೆ ರೂ 2.00 ಲಕ್ಷ ಮೀರಿರಬಾರದು.", "ವಿಕಲಚೇತನರಾಗಿದ್ದಲ್ಲಿ ಜಿಲ್ಲಾ ಅಂಗವಿಕಲ ಕಲ್ಯಾಣಾಧಿಕಾರಿಗಳಿಂದ ದೃಢೀಕರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟ ಪ್ರಮಾಣ ಪತ್ರ ಸಲ್ಲಿಸುವುದು."]', '[]', 1, '["ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಆಧಾರ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('d0bf970f-efbc-47f9-bed6-ade8317cad1f', 'SOCIAL-WELFARE-DEPAR-3', '81b60538-519f-4131-bd38-c390f2d882d6', 'Industrial Service Business - ISB (in association with Bank) Maximum Rs. 1 lakh subsidy', 'Subsidy', 0, 'Industrial Service Busines (in collaboration with the Bank) development scheme, assistance from the Corporation to start self-employment units for unemployed youths and women of the Scheduled Caste community in small scale industry, service sector and business sectors and the rest is loan from the bank. Subsidy of 20% of the unit cost or a maximum of Rs 1 lakh', '["Applicant Aadhar Cards (Mandatory)", "Applicant Ration Card (Mandatory)", "Applicant Voter ID (Mandatory)", "Caste & Income Certificate issued by competent authority (Mandatory)", "Project Report / Quotation (Mandatory)", "The applicant must declare they have not received prior assistance from the Corporation (Mandatory)", "Applicant Aadhar Card (Mandatory)", "Submission of certificate attested by The Disability Welfare Officer is required in disability cases (Optional)"]', '["Applicant should be resident of Karnataka state.", "Applicant should belong to a Scheduled Caste.", "Applicant Age should be between 21 to 56 years.", "None of the applicant''s family members should be employed in a government or semi-government position.", "The applicant or their family should not have availed any benefits or facilities from the Corporation previously.", "The applicant''s family annual income should not exceed Rs 1.5 lakh for rural areas and Rs 2.00 lakh for urban area.", "Submission of a certificate attested by the District Disability Welfare Officer is required in case of disability."]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, 'https://sevasindhuservices.karnataka.gov.in/', true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', 'b50adf7f-fb5f-444f-bdef-63731a6a9b80', 'ಉದ್ಯಮ ಶೀಲತಾ ಅಭಿವೃದ್ದಿ ಯೋಜನೆ -ಐ.ಎಸ್.ಬಿ (ಬ್ಯಾಂಕ್', 'Industrial Service Business 1.0', NULL, NULL, 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ಉದ್ಯಮ ಶೀಲತಾ ಅಭಿವೃದ್ದಿ ಯೋಜನೆ -ಐ.ಎಸ್.ಬಿ (ಬ್ಯಾಂಕ್', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["ಕರ್ನಾಟಕ ರಾಜ್ಯದ ನಿವಾಸಿಯಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿ ಸಮುದಾಯಕ್ಕೆ ಸೇರಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ವಯಸ್ಸು 21 ರಿಂದ 56 ವರ್ಷದೊಳಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸದಸ್ಯರು, ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ/ಅರೆ ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ ಸಂಸ್ಥೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಉದ್ಯೋಗಿಯಾಗಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಅಥವಾ ಅವರ ಕುಟುಂಬದವರು ಈ ಹಿಂದೆ ನಿಗಮದಿಂದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸೌಲಭ್ಯ ಪಡೆದಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ವಾರ್ಷಿಕ ಆದಾಯ ಗ್ರಾಮೀಣ ಭಾಗಕ್ಕೆ ರೂ 1.5 ಲಕ್ಷ ಹಾಗೂ ನಗರ ಪ್ರದೇಶದಲ್ಲಿರುವವರಿಗೆ ರೂ 2.00 ಲಕ್ಷ ಮೀರಿರಬಾರದು.", "ವಿಕಲಚೇತನರಾಗಿದ್ದಲ್ಲಿ ಜಿಲ್ಲಾ ಅಂಗವಿಕಲ ಕಲ್ಯಾಣಾಧಿಕಾರಿಗಳಿಂದ ದೃಢೀಕರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟ ಪ್ರಮಾಣ ಪತ್ರ ಸಲ್ಲಿಸುವುದು."]', '[]', 1, '["ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಆಧಾರ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('3c2e63a4-13fd-4a6b-995e-07bccf1a82b5', 'SOCIAL-WELFARE-DEPAR-2', '81b60538-519f-4131-bd38-c390f2d882d6', 'Ganga Kalyana', 'Loan with Subsidy', 0, 'Under this scheme, irrigation facilities are provided to small and very small scheduled caste farmers with 1½ to 5.00 acres of land by drilling boreholes, installing pump sets, and electrifying them. In certain districts such as Kolar, Chikkaballapur, Bangalore (Rural), Bangalore (City), Tumkur, and Ramnagar, the unit cost has been increased to Rs.4.75 lakh due to declining groundwater levels. Of this amount, Rs.4.25 lakh will be subsidized, and the remaining Rs.50,000/- will be provided as a term loan.In other districts, the unit cost is fixed at Rs.3.75 lakh, with Rs.3.25 lakh provided as a subsidy and Rs.50,000/- lakh as a term loan. Additionally, out of the unit cost, Rs.75,000 per borehole will be allocated to the respective Escom for electrification, within the subsidy limit of the unit cost.', '["Applicant Aadhar Cards (Optional)", "Ration Card (Mandatory)", "Aadhar linked PassBook Front Page Photo (Mandatory)", "Caste & Income Certificate issued by competent authority (Optional)", "The applicant must declare they have not received prior assistance from the Corporation (Optional)", "Passport size photo of the applicant (Mandatory)", "Small and Marginal Farmer Certificate (Mandatory)", "RTC (Mandatory)", "Submission of certificate attested by The Disability Welfare Officer is required in disability cases (Optional)"]', '["Applicant should be resident of Karnataka state.", "Applicant should belong to a Scheduled Caste.", "Applicants must be at least 21 years old and there is no upper age limit.", "None of the applicant''s family members should be employed in a government or semi-government position.", "The applicant or their family should not have availed any benefits or facilities from the Corporation previously.", "The applicant''s family annual income should not exceed Rs 1.5 lakh for rural areas and Rs 2.00 lakh for urban area.", "Submission of a certificate attested by the District Disability Welfare Officer is required in case of disability.", "The applicants must be small and medium marginal farmers and should not have access to irrigation facilities."]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, 'https://sevasindhuservices.karnataka.gov.in/', true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', 'b50adf7f-fb5f-444f-bdef-63731a6a9b80', 'ಗಂಗಾ ಕಲ್ಯಾಣ ಯೋಜನೆ', 'Ganga Kalyana', NULL, NULL, 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ಈ ಯೋಜನೆಯಡಿ 1½ ಎಕರೆಯಿಂದ 5.00 ಎಕರೆ ಜಮೀನು ಹೊಂದಿರುವ ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿಯ ಸಣ್ಣ ಮತ್ತು ಅತೀ ಸಣ್ಣ ರೈತರ ಜಮೀನಿನಲ್ಲಿ ಕೊಳವೆಬಾವಿ ಕೊರೆಸಿ, ಪಂಪ್ ಸೆಟ್ ಅಳವಡಿಸಿ ವಿದ್ಯುದ್ಧೀಕರಣಗೊಳಿಸಿ ನೀರಾವರಿ ಸೌಲಭ್ಯ ಕಲ್ಪಿಸಲಾಗುತ್ತಿದೆ. ಈ ಯೋಜನೆಯಡಿ ಕೋಲಾರ, ಚಿಕ್ಕಬಳ್ಳಾಪುರ, ಬೆಂಗಳೂರು(ಗ್ರಾ), ಬೆಂಗಳೂರು(ನಗರ), ತುಮಕೂರು ಮತ್ತು ರಾಮನಗರ ಜಿಲ್ಲೆಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಅಂತರ್ಜಲ ಮಟ್ಟ ಕೆಳಗೆ ಕುಸಿದಿರುವುದರಿಂದ ಈ ಜಿಲ್ಲೆಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಘಟಕ ವೆಚ್ಚ ರೂ.4.75 ಲಕ್ಷಕ್ಕೆ ಹೆಚ್ಚಿಸಲಾಗಿದ್ದು, ಇದರಲ್ಲಿ ರೂ.4.25 ಲಕ್ಷ ಸಹಾಯಧನವಿದ್ದು, ಉಳಿದ ರೂ.50,000/- ಅವಧಿಸಾಲವಾಗಿರುತ್ತದೆ. ಇತರೆ ಜಿಲ್ಲೆಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಘಟಕ ವೆಚ್ಚ ರೂ.3.75 ಲಕ್ಷ ನಿಗದಿಪಡಿಸಿದ್ದು, ಇದರಲ್ಲಿ ರೂ.3.25 ಲಕ್ಷ ಸಹಾಯಧನ ಮತ್ತು ರೂ.50,000/- ಅವಧಿಸಾಲವಾಗಿರುತ್ತದೆ. ಘಟಕ ವೆಚ್ಚದ ಪೈಕಿ ವಿದ್ಯುದ್ದೀಕರಣಕ್ಕೆ ಘಟಕ ವೆಚ್ಚದ ಸಹಾಯಧನದ ಮಿತಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಪ್ರತಿ ಕೊಳವೆಬಾವಿಗೆ ರೂ.75,000/-ಗಳನ್ನು ಸಂಬಂಧಿಸಿದ ಎಸ್ಕಾಂಗಳಿಗೆ ಬಿಡುಗಡೆ ಮಾಡಲಾಗುವುದು.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["ಕರ್ನಾಟಕ ರಾಜ್ಯದ ನಿವಾಸಿಯಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿ ಸಮುದಾಯಕ್ಕೆ ಸೇರಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರು ಕನಿಷ್ಠ 21 ವರ್ಷಗಳು ಪೂರ್ಣಗೊಂಡಿರಬೇಕು ಗರಿಷ್ಠ ವಯೋಮಿತಿ ತೆಗೆದು ಹಾಕಲಾಗಿದೆ.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸದಸ್ಯರು, ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ/ಅರೆ ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ ಸಂಸ್ಥೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಉದ್ಯೋಗಿಯಾಗಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಅಥವಾ ಅವರ ಕುಟುಂಬದವರು ಈ ಹಿಂದೆ ನಿಗಮದಿಂದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸೌಲಭ್ಯ ಪಡೆದಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ವಾರ್ಷಿಕ ಆದಾಯ ಗ್ರಾಮೀಣ ಭಾಗಕ್ಕೆ ರೂ 1.5 ಲಕ್ಷ ಹಾಗೂ ನಗರ ಪ್ರದೇಶದಲ್ಲಿರುವವರಿಗೆ ರೂ 2.00 ಲಕ್ಷ ಮೀರಿರಬಾರದು.", "ವಿಕಲಚೇತನರಾಗಿದ್ದಲ್ಲಿ ಜಿಲ್ಲಾ ಅಂಗವಿಕಲ ಕಲ್ಯಾಣಾಧಿಕಾರಿಗಳಿಂದ ದೃಢೀಕರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟ ಪ್ರಮಾಣ ಪತ್ರ ಸಲ್ಲಿಸುವುದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರು ಸಣ್ಣ ಮತ್ತು ಅತಿ ಸಣ್ಣ ರೈತರಾಗಿರಬೇಕು ಹಾಗೂ ನೀರಾವರಿ ಸೌಲಭ್ಯ ಹೊಂದಿರಬಾರದು."]', '[]', 1, '["ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಆಧಾರ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('641cc5e3-fdae-415a-89e1-206b487ebe51', 'SOCIAL-WELFARE-DEPAR-1', '81b60538-519f-4131-bd38-c390f2d882d6', 'Dairy Farming Scheme', 'Subsidy', 0, 'Under the Dairy Farming Scheme, beneficiaries are provided a subsidy of ₹1.25 lakhs to support the establishment and development of dairy farming for sustainable livelihood and milk production', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, 'https://sevasindhuservices.karnataka.gov.in/', true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', 'b50adf7f-fb5f-444f-bdef-63731a6a9b80', 'ಹೈನುಗಾರಿಕೆ ಯೋಜನೆ', 'Dairy Farming Scheme', NULL, NULL, 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ಈ ಯೋಜನೆಯ ಅಡಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಫಲಾನುಭವಿಗಳಿಗೆ ಹೈನುಗಾರಿಕೆಯನ್ನು ಸ್ಥಾಪಿಸಲು ಮತ್ತು ಅಭಿವೃದ್ಧಿಪಡಿಸಲು ₹1.25 ಲಕ್ಷಗಳ ಸಹಾಯಧನವನ್ನು ನೀಡಲಾಗುತ್ತದೆ, ಇದು ಸ್ಥಿರ ಜೀವನೋಪಾಯ ಮತ್ತು ಹಾಲು ಉತ್ಪಾದನೆಗೆ ನೆರವಾಗುತ್ತದೆ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '[]', 1, '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('288b5b24-18ac-491e-a35e-7c6e39b3fc43', 'SKILL-DEVELOPMENT-EN-1', 'c2857b0d-52a5-4fde-8ceb-9f44ca7bf0a1', 'Training and Guidance in Entrepreneurship Development', 'General', 0, 'Entrepreneurship Development Training Programs for unemployed youths / women / aspiring prospective entrepreneurs, who are interested to start their own enterprises.', '["Age Proof (SSLC Marks Card or other relavant document)"]', '["Candidates aged between 18 and 45 years and able to read and write."]', '[]', '["If a large number of applications are received, selection will be made through an interview."]', NULL, NULL, NULL, true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', '63d138e3-e563-4292-88ce-82b9e54451fc', 'ಉದ್ಯಮಶೀಲತಾಭಿವೃದ್ಧಿ ತರಬೇತಿ ಹಾಗೂ ಮಾಗ೯ದಶ೯ನ.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, NULL, 'ತಮ್ಮದೇ ಆದ ಉದ್ಯಮವನ್ನು ಪ್ರಾರಂಭಿಸಲು ಆಸಕ್ತಿ ಹೊಂದಿರುವ ನಿರುದ್ಯೋಗಿ ಯುವಕ / ಯುವತಿಯರು, ಮಹಿಳೆಯರು, ಆಸಕ್ತ ಭಾವೀ ಉದ್ಯಮಶೀಲರಿಗೆ ಉದ್ಯಮಶೀಲತಾಭಿವೃದ್ಧಿ ತರಬೇತಿ ಕಾಯ೯ಕ್ರಮಗಳು', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["18 ರಿಂದ 45 ವಷ೯ ವಯೋಮಿತಿಯಲ್ಲಿರುವ ಓದು ಬರಹ ಬಲ್ಲವರಾಗಿರಬೇಕು."]', '["ಹೆಚ್ಚಿನ ಅಜಿ೯ ಬಂದಲ್ಲಿ ಸಂದಶ೯ನ ಮೂಲಕ ತರಬೇತಿಗೆ ಆಯ್ಕೆ ಮಾಡಲಾಗುವುದು."]', 1, '["ವಯಸ್ಸಿನ ಪ್ರಮಾಣ ಪತ್ರ (ಎಸ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('dce884d0-96ae-4dc3-9628-93009f86c080', 'SOCIAL-WELFARE-DEPAR-74', '81b60538-519f-4131-bd38-c390f2d882d6', 'Dr. Babu Jagjeevan Ram Two Wheeler Cargo Transport Scheme', 'LoanWithSubsidy', 0, 'In 2022-23, a scheme will be implemented to promote self-employment and increase self-confidence among Scheduled Castes and Scheduled Tribes youth. This scheme is designed to facilitate e-commerce businesses and create employment in other services. Under this scheme, beneficiaries who purchase electric or other two-wheeler/three-wheeler goods transport vehicles will receive a subsidy of Rs. 50,000 and a loan of Rs. 20,000.', '["Applicant Aadhar Card (Mandatory)", "Applicant Photo (Mandatory)", "Applicant Voter ID (Mandatory)", "Applicant Ration Card (Mandatory)", "Caste & Income Certificate issued by competent authority (Mandatory)", "Must Possess Relevant Vehicle Driving License (Mandatory)", "Must Possess Relevant Vehicle Quotation (Mandatory)", "In E-Commerce, submit proof of employment or a self-affidavit for selling goods (Mandatory)", "Submission of certificate attested by The Disability Welfare Officer is required in disability cases (Optional)", "The applicant must declare they have not received prior assistance from the Corporation (Optional)"]', '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', '510cb0cd-4144-4dd8-8ce7-f874f44c1f53', 'ಡಾ. ಬಾಬು ಜಗಜೀವನ ರಾಂ ದ್ವಿಚಕ್ರ ವಾಹನ ಸರಕು ಸಾಗಾಣಿಕೆ ಯೋಜನೆ', 'Dr. Babu Jagjeevan Ram Two Wheeler Cargo Transport Scheme', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2022-23 ನೇ ಸಾಲಿನಲ್ಲಿ ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿ ಮತ್ತು ವರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಪಂಗಡದ ಯುವಕರಲ್ಲಿ ಸ್ವಯಂ ಉದ್ಯೋಗವನ್ನು ಉತ್ತೇಜಿಸಲು ಮತ್ತು ಆತ್ಮವಿಶ್ವಾಸವನ್ನು ಹೆಚ್ಚಿಸಲು , ಇ-ಕಾಮರ್ಸ್ ವ್ಯವಹಾರಗಳನ್ನು ಸುಲಭಗೊಳಿಸಲು ಮತ್ತು ಇತರ ಸೇವೆಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಉದ್ಯೋಗವನ್ನು ಸೃಷ್ಟಿಸಲು ಈ ಯೋಜನೆಯನ್ನು ವಿನ್ಯಾಸಗೊಳಿಸಲಾಗಿದೆ. ಈ ಯೋಜನೆಯಡಿಯಲ್ಲಿ, ವಿದ್ಯುತ್ ಅಥವಾ ಇತರೆ ಎರಡು/ಮೂರು ಚಕ್ರದ ಸರಕು ಸಾಗಣೆ ವಾಹನಗಳನ್ನು ಖರೀದಿಸುವ ಫಲಾನುಭವಿಗಳಿಗೆ ರೂ. 50,000 ಸಹಾಯಧನ ಹಾಗೂ ರೂ. 20,000 ಸಾಲವನ್ನು ನೀಡಲಾಗುತ್ತದೆ.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '[]', 1, '["ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಆಧಾರ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('8c46e47a-0657-4ed8-97f1-231dfced88ec', 'SOCIAL-WELFARE-DEPAR-73', '81b60538-519f-4131-bd38-c390f2d882d6', 'Swavalambi / Sanchari Sales Outlet Scheme', 'Subsidy', 0, 'The objective is to provide self-employment by offering an opportunity for traditional leather artisans to sell leather products and other related items directly to customers'' doorsteps through a mobile vehicle.. For this project, subsidies are allocated as follows: up to taluk level, Rs. 2.00 lakh; at the Taluk/District Center, Rs. 3.00 lakh; within Metropolitan Corporation coverage, Rs. 4.00 lakh; and within B.B.M.P. Range, Rs. 5.00 lakh. The remaining amount, equivalent to or exceeding the subsidy, should be obtained from the bank.', '["Applicant Aadhar Card (Mandatory)", "Applicant Photo (Mandatory)", "Applicant Voter ID (Mandatory)", "Applicant Ration Card (Mandatory)", "Caste & Income Certificate issued by competent authority (Mandatory)", "Must Possess Relevant Vehicle Driving License (Mandatory)", "Must Possess Relevant Vehicle Quotation (Mandatory)", "In E-Commerce, submit proof of employment or a self-affidavit for selling goods (Mandatory)", "Submission of certificate attested by The Disability Welfare Officer is required in disability cases (Optional)", "The applicant must declare they have not received prior assistance from the Corporation (Optional)"]', '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', '510cb0cd-4144-4dd8-8ce7-f874f44c1f53', '“ಸ್ವಾವಲಂಬಿ” / “ಸಂಚಾರಿ” ಮಾರಾಟ ಮಳಿಗೆ ಯೋಜನೆ', 'Swavalambi / Sanchari Sales Outlet Scheme', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ಪಾರಂಪರಿಕ ಚರ್ಮ ಕುಶಲಕರ್ಮಿಗಳು ತಯಾರಿಸಿದ ಚರ್ಮೋತ್ಪನ್ನಗಳನ್ನು / ಇತರೆ ಸಂಬಂಧಿತ ಉತ್ಪನ್ನಗಳನ್ನು ಸಂಚಾರಿ ವಾಹನದ ಮೂಲಕ ಗ್ರಾಹಕರ ನೇರವಾಗಿ ಮನೆ ಬಾಗಿಲಿಗೆ ಹೋಗಿ ಮಾರಾಟ ಮಾಡಲು ಅವಕಾಶ ಕಲ್ಪಸಿ ಸ್ವಯಂ ಉದ್ಯೋಗ ಒದಗಿಸುವ ಉದ್ದೇಶ ಹೊಂದಿದೆ. ಈ ಯೋಜನೆಗೆ ತಾಲ್ಲೂಕು ಮಟ್ಟದವರೆಗೆ ರೂ. 2.00 ಲಕ್ಷ, ತಾಲ್ಲೂಕು/ಜಿಲ್ಲಾ ಕೇಂದ್ರ ರೂ. 3.00 ಲಕ್ಷ, ಮಹಾನಗರ ಪಾಲಿಕೆ ವ್ಯಾಪ್ತಿ ರೂ. 4.00 ಲಕ್ಷ, ಬಿ.ಬಿ.ಎಂ.ಪಿ. ವ್ಯಾಪ್ತಿ ರೂ. 5.00 ಲಕ್ಷ ಸಹಾಯಧನ ಮತ್ತು ಉಳಿದ ಮೊತ್ತ ಅಂದರೆ ಸಹಾಯಧನದಷ್ಟೆ ಅಥವಾ ಅದಕ್ಕಿಂತ ಮೇಲ್ಪಟ್ಟು ಬ್ಯಾಂಕ್ ಸಾಲ ಪಡೆದಿರಬೇಕು.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '[]', 1, '["ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಆಧಾರ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('ceaa245d-b2ad-48e3-919b-064a692d712f', 'SOCIAL-WELFARE-DEPAR-72', '81b60538-519f-4131-bd38-c390f2d882d6', 'Skill Upgradation Programme', 'Subsidy', 0, 'Skill Upgradation Programme', '["Applicant Aadhar Card (Mandatory)", "Applicant Photo (Mandatory)", "Applicant Voter ID (Mandatory)", "Applicant Ration Card (Mandatory)", "Caste & Income Certificate issued by competent authority (Mandatory)", "Must Possess Relevant Vehicle Driving License (Mandatory)", "Must Possess Relevant Vehicle Quotation (Mandatory)", "In E-Commerce, submit proof of employment or a self-affidavit for selling goods (Mandatory)", "Submission of certificate attested by The Disability Welfare Officer is required in disability cases (Optional)", "The applicant must declare they have not received prior assistance from the Corporation (Optional)"]', '["Applicant should be resident of Karnataka state.", "Applicant should belong to a Scheduled Caste.", "The applicant''s family annual income should not exceed Rs 1.5 lakh for rural areas and Rs 2.00 lakh for urban area.", "Applicant Age should be between 21 to 60 years.", "The applicant or their family should not have availed any benefits or facilities from the Corporation previously.", "Submission of certificate attested by The Disability Welfare Officer is required in disability cases."]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, 'https://sevasindhuservices.karnataka.gov.in/', true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', '510cb0cd-4144-4dd8-8ce7-f874f44c1f53', 'ಕೌಶಲ್ಯ ಉನ್ನತೀಕರಣ ಕಾರ್ಯಕ್ರಮ', 'Skill Upgradation Programme', NULL, NULL, 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ಕೌಶಲ್ಯ ಉನ್ನತೀಕರಣ ಕಾರ್ಯಕ್ರಮ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["ಕರ್ನಾಟಕ ರಾಜ್ಯದ ನಿವಾಸಿಯಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರು ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿ ಸಮುದಾಯಕ್ಕೆ ಸೇರಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ವಾರ್ಷಿಕ ಆದಾಯ ಗ್ರಾಮೀಣ ಭಾಗಕ್ಕೆ ರೂ 1.5 ಲಕ್ಷ ಹಾಗೂ ನಗರ ಪ್ರದೇಶದಲ್ಲಿರುವವರಿಗೆ ರೂ 2.00 ಲಕ್ಷ ಮೀರಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ವಯಸ್ಸು 21 ರಿಂದ 60 ವರ್ಷದೊಳಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಅಥವಾ ಅವರ ಕುಟುಂಬದವರು ಈ ಹಿಂದೆ ನಿಗಮದಿಂದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸೌಲಭ್ಯ ಪಡೆದಿರಬಾರದು.", "ವಿಕಲಚೇತನರಾಗಿದ್ದಲ್ಲಿ ಜಿಲ್ಲಾ ಅಂಗವಿಕಲ ಕಲ್ಯಾಣಾಧಿಕಾರಿಗಳಿಂದ ದೃಢೀಕರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟ ಪ್ರಮಾಣ ಪತ್ರ ಸಲ್ಲಿಸುವುದು."]', '[]', 1, '["ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಆಧಾರ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('b7da9765-4aca-4e75-9ebd-d0d7914da299', 'SOCIAL-WELFARE-DEPAR-71', '81b60538-519f-4131-bd38-c390f2d882d6', 'Kayaka Spoorthi Yojane', 'LoanWithSubsidy', 0, 'A group of at least 10 women who have received training under the Kayaka Spoorthi Yojane will form self-help groups and engage in leather handicrafts-related economic activities. Each group will be provided with a minimum economic support of up to Rs. 2.50 lakh to initiate income-generating activities and become self-reliant. This support will include Rs. 1.50 lakh as grant assistance and Rs. 1.00 lakh as interest-free loan. (Each skilled woman worker will receive Rs. 15,000 grant assistance and Rs. 10,000 loan)', '["Applicant Aadhar Cards (Mandatory)", "Applicant Ration Card (Mandatory)", "Applicant Voter ID (Mandatory)", "Caste & Income Certificate issued by competent authority (Mandatory)", "Vehicle Quotation (Mandatory)", "The applicant must declare they have not received prior assistance from the Corporation (Mandatory)", "Applicant Photo (Mandatory)", "Bank Pass Book (with Cover Page) (Mandatory)", "Vehicle Driving License(DL) (Mandatory)"]', '["Applicant should be resident of Karnataka state.", "Applicant should belong to a Scheduled Caste.", "Applicant Age should be between 21 to 56 years.", "None of the applicant''s family members should be employed in a government or semi-government position.", "The applicant or their family should not have availed any benefits or facilities from the Corporation previously.", "The applicant''s family annual income should not exceed Rs 1.5 lakh for rural areas and Rs 2.00 lakh for urban area."]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, 'https://sevasindhuservices.karnataka.gov.in/', true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', '510cb0cd-4144-4dd8-8ce7-f874f44c1f53', 'ಕಾಯಕಸ್ಪೂರ್ತಿ ಯೋಜನೆ', 'Kayaka Spoorthi Yojane', NULL, NULL, 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ಕಾಯಕಸ್ಪೂರ್ತಿ ಯೋಜನೆಯಡಿ ತರಬೇತಿ ಪಡೆದ ಕನಿಷ್ಟ 10 ಮಹಿಳೆಯರು ಸೇರಿ ಸ್ವ-ಸಹಾಯ ಸಂಘ ರಚಿಸಿಕೊಂಡು ಚರ್ಮ ಕೈಗಾರಿಕೆಗೆ ಸಂಬಂಧಿಸಿದ ಗುಂಪು ಆರ್ಥಿಕ ಚಟುವಟಿಕೆಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ತೊಡಗಿಸಿಕೊಂಡು ತನ್ಮೂಲಕ ಆದಾಯಗಳಿಸಿ ಸ್ವಾವಲಂಬಿಗಳಾಗಲು ಮುಂದೆ ಬಂದಲ್ಲಿ ಪ್ರತಿ ಸಂಘಕ್ಕೆ ಗರಿಷ್ಟ ರೂ. 2.50 ಲಕ್ಷ ಆರ್ಥಿಕ ನೆರವು ಒದಗಿಸಲಾಗುವುದು. ಇದರಲ್ಲಿ ರೂ. 1.50 ಲಕ್ಷ ಸಹಾಯ ಧನ ಮತ್ತು ರೂ. 1.00 ಲಕ್ಷವನ್ನು ಸಾಲದ ರೂಪದಲ್ಲಿ ನೀಡಲಾಗುವುದು. (ಪ್ರತಿ ಮಹಿಳಾ ಕುಶಲಕರ್ಮಿಗೆ ರೂ. 15,000/- ಸಹಾಯಧನ ಮತ್ತು ರೂ. 10,000/-)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["ಕರ್ನಾಟಕ ರಾಜ್ಯದ ನಿವಾಸಿಯಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿ ಸಮುದಾಯಕ್ಕೆ ಸೇರಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ವಯಸ್ಸು 21 ರಿಂದ 56 ವರ್ಷದೊಳಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸದಸ್ಯರು, ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ/ಅರೆ ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ ಸಂಸ್ಥೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಉದ್ಯೋಗಿಯಾಗಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಅಥವಾ ಅವರ ಕುಟುಂಬದವರು ಈ ಹಿಂದೆ ನಿಗಮದಿಂದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸೌಲಭ್ಯ ಪಡೆದಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ವಾರ್ಷಿಕ ಆದಾಯ ಗ್ರಾಮೀಣ ಭಾಗಕ್ಕೆ ರೂ 1.5 ಲಕ್ಷ ಹಾಗೂ ನಗರ ಪ್ರದೇಶದಲ್ಲಿರುವವರಿಗೆ ರೂ 2.00 ಲಕ್ಷ ಮೀರಿರಬಾರದು."]', '[]', 1, '["ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಆಧಾರ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('ae0d2d5e-9c95-4708-8377-5a1357ff6265', 'SOCIAL-WELFARE-DEPAR-70', '81b60538-519f-4131-bd38-c390f2d882d6', 'Self employment Loan and Subsidy (Direct Loan)', 'LoanWithSubsidy', 0, 'To support the livelihoods of leather artisans engaged in small businesses at home or roadside, microeconomic activities will be facilitated. Rs. 1.00 lakh will be granted, with a loan of Rs. 50,000 allocated as unit cost and the remaining Rs. 50,000 provided as subsidy for self-employment purposes.', '["Applicant Aadhar Cards (Mandatory)", "Applicant Ration Card (Mandatory)", "Applicant Voter ID (Mandatory)", "Caste & Income Certificate issued by competent authority (Mandatory)", "Vehicle Quotation (Mandatory)", "The applicant must declare they have not received prior assistance from the Corporation (Mandatory)", "Applicant Photo (Mandatory)", "Bank Pass Book (with Cover Page) (Mandatory)", "Vehicle Driving License(DL) (Mandatory)"]', '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, 'https://sevasindhuservices.karnataka.gov.in/', true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', '510cb0cd-4144-4dd8-8ce7-f874f44c1f53', 'ಸ್ವಯಂ ಉದ್ಯೋಗ ಸಾಲ ಮತ್ತು ಸಬ್ಸಿಡಿ (ನೇರ ಸಾಲ)', 'Self employment Loan and Subsidy (Direct Loan)', NULL, NULL, 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ಮನೆಗಳಲ್ಲಿ / ರಸ್ತೆ ಬದಿ ಕುಳಿತು ಕಾಯಕದಲ್ಲಿ ತೊಡಗಿರುವ ಮತ್ತು ಸಣ್ಣ ಪುಟ್ಟ ವ್ಯಾಪಾರ ಮಾಡಿಕೊಂಡಿರುವ ಚರ್ಮ ಕುಶಲಕರ್ಮಿಗಳಿಗೆ ಕಿರು ಆರ್ಥಿಕ ಚಟುವಟಿಕೆಗಳನ್ನು ಕೈಗೊಂಡು ಜೀವನೋಪಾಯಕ್ಕೆ ಅನುಕೂಲವಾಗುವಂತೆ ರೂ. 1.00 ಲಕ್ಷಗಳ ಘಟಕ ವೆಚ್ಚದಲ್ಲಿ ನಿಗಮದಿಂದ ರೂ. 50,000/-ಗಳ ಸಾಲ ಮತ್ತು ರೂ. 50,000/- ಗಳ ಸಹಾಯಧನ ಒದಗಿಸಿ ಸ್ವಯಂ ಉದ್ಯೋಗ ಕಲ್ಪಿಸಲಾಗುವುದು.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '[]', 1, '["ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಆಧಾರ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('69a55519-f657-459d-9b57-1db8c5dfd41f', 'SOCIAL-WELFARE-DEPAR-69', '81b60538-519f-4131-bd38-c390f2d882d6', 'Skill Development Training', 'Subsidy', 0, 'Dr Babu Jagjivan Ram Leather development industry Bangalore. the corporation is well known as LIDKAR, and organized 60 days of skill development and income generation training program.', '["Applicant''s Aadhar Cards (Mandatory)", "Applicant''s Ration Card (Mandatory)", "Applicant''s Voter ID (Mandatory)", "Caste & Income Certificate issued by competent authority (Mandatory)", "The applicant must declare they have not received prior assistance from the Corporation (Mandatory)", "Applicant''s Photo (Mandatory)", "Bank Pass Book (with Cover Page) (Mandatory)", "Should Have Valid Association Registration Copy (Mandatory)", "Copy of at least 3 months'' worth of recent association meeting minutes (Mandatory)"]', '["Applicant should be resident of Karnataka state.", "Applicant should belong to a Scheduled Caste.", "Applicant Age should be between 21 to 60 years.", "None of the applicant''s family members should be employed in a government or semi-government position.", "The applicant or their family should not have availed any benefits or facilities from the Corporation previously.", "The applicant''s family annual income should not exceed Rs 1.5 lakh for rural areas and Rs 2.00 lakh for urban area.", "Submission of a certificate attested by the District Disability Welfare Officer is required in case of disability.", "Registered Copy of Self Help Group.", "Out of the 60% Scheduled Caste members of the association, 40% of the members should belong to the sub-castes belonging to the corporation.", "Members of the SHG should have ration card."]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, 'https://sevasindhuservices.karnataka.gov.in/', true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', '510cb0cd-4144-4dd8-8ce7-f874f44c1f53', 'ಕೌಶಲ್ಯ ಅಭಿವೃದ್ಧಿ ತರಬೇತಿ', 'Skill Development Training', NULL, NULL, 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ಡಾ ಬಾಬು ಜಗಜೀವನ್ ರಾಮ್ ಚರ್ಮ ಅಭಿವೃದ್ಧಿ ಉದ್ಯಮ ಬೆಂಗಳೂರು. ನಿಗಮವು LIDKAR ಎಂದು ಪ್ರಸಿದ್ಧವಾಗಿದೆ ಮತ್ತು 60 ದಿನಗಳ ಕೌಶಲ್ಯ ಅಭಿವೃದ್ಧಿ ಮತ್ತು ಆದಾಯ ಉತ್ಪಾದನಾ ತರಬೇತಿ ಕಾರ್ಯಕ್ರಮವನ್ನು ಆಯೋಜಿಸಿದೆ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["ಕರ್ನಾಟಕ ರಾಜ್ಯದ ನಿವಾಸಿಯಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿ ಸಮುದಾಯಕ್ಕೆ ಸೇರಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ವಯಸ್ಸು 21 ರಿಂದ 60 ವರ್ಷದೊಳಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸದಸ್ಯರು, ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ/ಅರೆ ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ ಸಂಸ್ಥೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಉದ್ಯೋಗಿಯಾಗಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಅಥವಾ ಅವರ ಕುಟುಂಬದವರು ಈ ಹಿಂದೆ ನಿಗಮದಿಂದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸೌಲಭ್ಯ ಪಡೆದಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ವಾರ್ಷಿಕ ಆದಾಯ ಗ್ರಾಮೀಣ ಭಾಗಕ್ಕೆ ರೂ 1.5 ಲಕ್ಷ ಹಾಗೂ ನಗರ ಪ್ರದೇಶದಲ್ಲಿರುವವರಿಗೆ ರೂ 2.00 ಲಕ್ಷ ಮೀರಿರಬಾರದು.", "ವಿಕಲಚೇತನರಾಗಿದ್ದಲ್ಲಿ ಜಿಲ್ಲಾ ಅಂಗವಿಕಲ ಕಲ್ಯಾಣಾಧಿಕಾರಿಗಳಿಂದ ದೃಢೀಕರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟ ಪ್ರಮಾಣ ಪತ್ರ ಸಲ್ಲಿಸುವುದು.", "ಚಾಲ್ತಿಯಲ್ಲಿರುವ ಸಂಘದ ನೊಂದಣಿ ಪತ್ರ.", "ಸಂಘದ ಶೇ 60 ರ ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿಯ ಸದಸ್ಯರುಗಳ ಪೈಕಿ ಶೇ 40 ರಷ್ಟು ಸದಸ್ಯರು ನಿಗಮಕ್ಕೆ ಸೇರಿದ ಉಪ ಜಾತಿಯವರಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಸಂಘದ ಸದಸ್ಯರು ಪಡಿತರ ಚೀಟಿಯನ್ನು ಹೊಂದಿರಬೇಕು."]', '[]', 1, '["ಎಲ್ಲಾ ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಆಧಾರ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('f9cd3948-ec29-4f5a-9547-e0e6c7f68638', 'SOCIAL-WELFARE-DEPAR-68', '81b60538-519f-4131-bd38-c390f2d882d6', 'Paduke Kuteera', 'LoanWithSubsidy', 0, 'Approved by local authorities and sanctioned upon application, the pavement-dwelling leather artisans will be provided with sheltered footpath stalls by the municipal corporation. This is to enable them to carry out their work respectfully, safely, and securely while being seated on the pavement and associated with local organizations relevant to the leather industry.', '["Applicant Aadhar Card (Optional)", "Ration card (Optional)", "Aadhar linked PassBook Front Page Photo (Optional)", "Caste & Income Certificate issued by competent authority (Optional)", "The applicant must declare they have not received prior assistance from the Corporation (Optional)", "Passport size Photo (Optional)", "Submission of certificate attested by The Disability Welfare Officer is required in disability cases (Optional)", "Project Report / Quotation (Optional)"]', '["Applicant should be resident of Karnataka state.", "Applicant should belong to a Scheduled Caste.", "Applicant Age should be between 21 to 60 years.", "None of the applicant''s family members should be employed in a government or semi-government position.", "The applicant or their family should not have availed any benefits or facilities from the Corporation previously.", "The applicant''s family annual income should not exceed Rs 1.5 lakh for rural areas and Rs 2.00 lakh for urban area.", "Submission of a certificate attested by the District Disability Welfare Officer is required in case of disability."]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, 'https://sevasindhuservices.karnataka.gov.in/', true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', '510cb0cd-4144-4dd8-8ce7-f874f44c1f53', 'ಪಾದುಕೆ ಕುಟೀರ', 'Paduke Kuteera', NULL, NULL, 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ರಸ್ತೆ ಬದಿ ಕುಳಿತು ಕಾಯಕ ನಿರ್ವಹಿಸುತ್ತಿರುವ ಚರ್ಮಕುಶಲಕರ್ಮಿಗಳು ಸಂಬಂಧಪಟ್ಟ ಸ್ಥಳೀಯ ಸಂಸ್ಥೆಗಳಿಂದ ಪರವಾನಗಿ ಪಡೆದು ಮತ್ತು ಮನವಿ ಸಲ್ಲಿಸಿದಲ್ಲಿ ಗೌರವಯುತವಾಗಿ ಹಾಗೂ ಸುರಕ್ಷಿತವಾಗಿ ನೆರಳಲ್ಲಿ ಕುಳಿತು ಕಾರ್ಯ ನಿರ್ವಹಿಸಲು ಅನುವಾಗುವಂತೆ ನಿಗಮದಿಂದ ಪಾದುಕ ಕುಟೀರಗಳನ್ನು ಒದಗಿಸಲಾಗುವುದು.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["ಕರ್ನಾಟಕ ರಾಜ್ಯದ ನಿವಾಸಿಯಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿ ಸಮುದಾಯಕ್ಕೆ ಸೇರಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ವಯಸ್ಸು 21 ರಿಂದ 60 ವರ್ಷದೊಳಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸದಸ್ಯರು, ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ/ಅರೆ ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ ಸಂಸ್ಥೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಉದ್ಯೋಗಿಯಾಗಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಅಥವಾ ಅವರ ಕುಟುಂಬದವರು ಈ ಹಿಂದೆ ನಿಗಮದಿಂದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸೌಲಭ್ಯ ಪಡೆದಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ವಾರ್ಷಿಕ ಆದಾಯ ಗ್ರಾಮೀಣ ಭಾಗಕ್ಕೆ ರೂ 1.5 ಲಕ್ಷ ಹಾಗೂ ನಗರ ಪ್ರದೇಶದಲ್ಲಿರುವವರಿಗೆ ರೂ 2.00 ಲಕ್ಷ ಮೀರಿರಬಾರದು.", "ವಿಕಲಚೇತನರಾಗಿದ್ದಲ್ಲಿ ಜಿಲ್ಲಾ ಅಂಗವಿಕಲ ಕಲ್ಯಾಣಾಧಿಕಾರಿಗಳಿಂದ ದೃಢೀಕರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟ ಪ್ರಮಾಣ ಪತ್ರ ಸಲ್ಲಿಸುವುದು."]', '[]', 1, '["ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಆಧಾರ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('21b0a1de-3558-422f-aa88-1057ca6b1abd', 'SOCIAL-WELFARE-DEPAR-67', '81b60538-519f-4131-bd38-c390f2d882d6', 'Kuteera', 'LoanWithSubsidy', 0, 'Approved by local authorities and sanctioned upon application, the pavement-dwelling leather artisans will be provided with sheltered footpath stalls by the municipal corporation. This is to enable them to carry out their work respectfully, safely, and securely while being seated on the pavement and associated with local organizations relevant to the leather industry.', '["Beneficiary Aadhaar Card As Residential Proof (Mandatory)", "Beneficiary Caste Certificate Issued by the competent authority (Mandatory)", "Beneficiary Income Certificate Issued by the competent authority (Mandatory)", "Letter of Landless Agricultural labourers (from Tahsildar) (Mandatory)", "Beneficiary Ration Card (Mandatory)", "Land Owners Cover letter for sale of land (To be notarized and submitted on Stamp paper.) (Mandatory)", "land owner Family Tree (To be verified and submitted by village accountants.) (Mandatory)", "Letter of No Objection (NOC) from Family Members (should be notarized and submitted.) (Mandatory)", "Latest pahani and mutation copy (Mandatory)", "Land Owners Last 13 years E.C. (Encumbrance Certificate should be submitted.) (Mandatory)", "Beneficiary Photo (Mandatory)"]', '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, 'https://sevasindhuservices.karnataka.gov.in/', true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', '510cb0cd-4144-4dd8-8ce7-f874f44c1f53', 'ಕುಟೀರ', 'Kuteera', NULL, NULL, 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ರಸ್ತೆ ಬದಿ ಕುಳಿತು ಕಾಯಕ ನಿರ್ವಹಿಸುತ್ತಿರುವ ಚರ್ಮಕುಶಲಕರ್ಮಿಗಳು ಸಂಬಂಧಪಟ್ಟ ಸ್ಥಳೀಯ ಸಂಸ್ಥೆಗಳಿಂದ ಪರವಾನಗಿ ಪಡೆದು ಮತ್ತು ಮನವಿ ಸಲ್ಲಿಸಿದಲ್ಲಿ ಗೌರವಯುತವಾಗಿ ಹಾಗೂ ಸುರಕ್ಷಿತವಾಗಿ ನೆರಳಲ್ಲಿ ಕುಳಿತು ಕಾರ್ಯ ನಿರ್ವಹಿಸಲು ಅನುವಾಗುವಂತೆ ನಿಗಮದಿಂದ ಪಾದುಕ ಕುಟೀರಗಳನ್ನು ಒದಗಿಸಲಾಗುವುದು.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '[]', 1, '["ಫಲಾನುಭವಿಯ ಆಧಾರ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('67b182b3-fd8b-44e5-a85c-e935ed4c6c71', 'SOCIAL-WELFARE-DEPAR-66', '81b60538-519f-4131-bd38-c390f2d882d6', 'Industrial Service Business - ISB (in association with Bank) 2.0', 'Subsidy', 0, '"Industrial Service Business (in collaboration with the Bank) development scheme, assistance from the Corporation to start self-employment units for unemployed youths and women of the Scheduled Caste community in small scale industry, service sector and business sectors and the rest is loan from the bank. Subsidy of 70% of the unit cost or a maximum of Rs 2 lakh"', '["Beneficiary Aadhaar Card As Residential Proof (Mandatory)", "Beneficiary Caste Certificate Issued by the competent authority (Mandatory)", "Beneficiary Income Certificate Issued by the competent authority (Mandatory)", "Letter of Landless Agricultural labourers (from Tahsildar) (Mandatory)", "Beneficiary Ration Card (Mandatory)", "Land Owners Cover letter for sale of land (To be notarized and submitted on Stamp paper.) (Mandatory)", "land owner Family Tree (To be verified and submitted by village accountants.) (Mandatory)", "Letter of No Objection (NOC) from Family Members (should be notarized and submitted.) (Mandatory)", "Latest pahani and mutation copy (Mandatory)", "Land Owners Last 13 years E.C. (Encumbrance Certificate should be submitted.) (Mandatory)", "Beneficiary Photo (Mandatory)"]', '["Applicants must belong to scheduled castes and its related community.", "The applicant must be a land less agriculture labour family.", "Self-declaration certificate must be submitted in case of caste certificate.", "Should be resident of Karnataka state.", "The applicant and no member of his family should not be in employment in any Govt./Semi Govt organization.", "The beneficiaries eligible to avail of facilities under the land ownership scheme must be landless women agricultural laborers.", "Additionally, the landowners selling the land should not belong to Scheduled Castes and Scheduled Tribes.", "The land to be purchased is a maximum of 10 km from the place where the beneficiary lives. m. should be within range."]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, 'https://sevasindhuservices.karnataka.gov.in/', true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', '510cb0cd-4144-4dd8-8ce7-f874f44c1f53', 'ಉದ್ಯಮ ಶೀಲತಾ ಅಭಿವೃದ್ದಿ ಯೋಜನೆ -ಐ.ಎಸ್.ಬಿ (ಬ್ಯಾಂಕ್', 'Industrial Service Business - ISB (in association with Bank) 2.0', NULL, NULL, 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, '"ಉದ್ಯಮ ಶೀಲತಾ ಅಭಿವೃದ್ದಿ ಯೋಜನೆ -ಐ.ಎಸ್.ಬಿ (ಬ್ಯಾಂಕ್', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರು ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿಯ ಸಂಬಂಧಿತ ಜಾತಿಗಳಿಗೆ ಸೇರಿದವರಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರು ಭೂ ರಹಿತ ಕೃಷಿ ಕಾರ್ಮಿಕ ಕುಟುಂಬದವರಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಜಾತಿ ಪ್ರಮಾಣ ಪತ್ರವನ್ನು ಸಲ್ಲಿಸಿದಲ್ಲಿ ಕಡ್ಡಾಯವಾಗಿ ಸ್ವಯಂ ಘೋಷಣೆ ಪ್ರಮಾಣ ಪತ್ರವನ್ನು ಸಲ್ಲಿಸಬೇಕು.", "ಕರ್ನಾಟಕ ರಾಜ್ಯದ ನಿವಾಸಿಯಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರು/ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ಅವಲಂಬಿತ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸದಸ್ಯರು ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ/ಅರೆ ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ ನೌಕರಿಯಲ್ಲಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಭೂಒಡೆತನ ಯೋಜನೆಯಡಿ ಸೌಲಭ್ಯ ಪಡೆಯಲು ಫಲಾಪೇಕ್ಷಿಯು ಭೂರಹಿತ ಮಹಿಳಾ ಕೃಷಿ ಕಾರ್ಮಿಕರಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಜಮೀನು ಮಾರಾಟ ಮಾಡುವ ಭೂಮಾಲೀಕರು ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟಜಾತಿ ಮತ್ತು ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಪಂಗಡಕ್ಕೆ ಸೇರಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಖರೀದಿಸುವ ಜಮೀನು ಫಲಾನುಭವಿಯು ವಾಸಿಸುತ್ತಿರುವ ಸ್ಥಳದಿಂದ ಗರಿಷ್ಠ 10 ಕಿ. ಮೀ. ವ್ಯಾಪ್ತಿಯೊಳಗೆ ಇರಬೇಕು."]', '[]', 1, '["ಫಲಾನುಭವಿಯ ಆಧಾರ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('30888186-3903-4da7-8779-024b04ea67ab', 'SOCIAL-WELFARE-DEPAR-65', '81b60538-519f-4131-bd38-c390f2d882d6', 'Industrial Service Business - ISB (in association with Bank) 1.0', 'Subsidy', 0, '"Industrial Service Busines (in collaboration with the Bank) development scheme, assistance from the Corporation to start self-employment units for unemployed youths and women of the Scheduled Caste community in small scale industry, service sector and business sectors and the rest is loan from the bank. Subsidy of 20% of the unit cost or a maximum of Rs 1 lakh"', '["Beneficiary Aadhaar Card As Residential Proof (Mandatory)", "Beneficiary Caste Certificate Issued by the competent authority (Mandatory)", "Beneficiary Income Certificate Issued by the competent authority (Mandatory)", "Letter of Landless Agricultural labourers (from Tahsildar) (Mandatory)", "Beneficiary Ration Card (Mandatory)", "Land Owners Cover letter for sale of land (To be notarized and submitted on Stamp paper.) (Mandatory)", "land owner Family Tree (To be verified and submitted by village accountants.) (Mandatory)", "Letter of No Objection (NOC) from Family Members (should be notarized and submitted.) (Mandatory)", "Latest pahani and mutation copy (Mandatory)", "Land Owners Last 13 years E.C. (Encumbrance Certificate should be submitted.) (Mandatory)", "Beneficiary Photo (Mandatory)"]', '["Applicants must belong to scheduled castes and its related community.", "The applicant must be a land less agriculture labour family.", "Self-declaration certificate must be submitted in case of caste certificate.", "Should be resident of Karnataka state.", "The applicant and no member of his family should not be in employment in any Govt./Semi Govt organization.", "The beneficiaries eligible to avail of facilities under the land ownership scheme must be landless women agricultural laborers.", "Additionally, the landowners selling the land should not belong to Scheduled Castes and Scheduled Tribes.", "The land to be purchased is a maximum of 10 km from the place where the beneficiary lives. m. should be within range."]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, 'https://sevasindhuservices.karnataka.gov.in/', true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', '510cb0cd-4144-4dd8-8ce7-f874f44c1f53', 'ಉದ್ಯಮ ಶೀಲತಾ ಅಭಿವೃದ್ದಿ ಯೋಜನೆ -ಐ.ಎಸ್.ಬಿ (ಬ್ಯಾಂಕ್', 'Industrial Service Business - ISB (in association with Bank) 1.0', NULL, NULL, 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, '"ಉದ್ಯಮ ಶೀಲತಾ ಅಭಿವೃದ್ದಿ ಯೋಜನೆ -ಐ.ಎಸ್.ಬಿ (ಬ್ಯಾಂಕ್', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರು ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿಯ ಸಂಬಂಧಿತ ಜಾತಿಗಳಿಗೆ ಸೇರಿದವರಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರು ಭೂ ರಹಿತ ಕೃಷಿ ಕಾರ್ಮಿಕ ಕುಟುಂಬದವರಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಜಾತಿ ಪ್ರಮಾಣ ಪತ್ರವನ್ನು ಸಲ್ಲಿಸಿದಲ್ಲಿ ಕಡ್ಡಾಯವಾಗಿ ಸ್ವಯಂ ಘೋಷಣೆ ಪ್ರಮಾಣ ಪತ್ರವನ್ನು ಸಲ್ಲಿಸಬೇಕು.", "ಕರ್ನಾಟಕ ರಾಜ್ಯದ ನಿವಾಸಿಯಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರು/ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ಅವಲಂಬಿತ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸದಸ್ಯರು ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ/ಅರೆ ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ ನೌಕರಿಯಲ್ಲಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಭೂಒಡೆತನ ಯೋಜನೆಯಡಿ ಸೌಲಭ್ಯ ಪಡೆಯಲು ಫಲಾಪೇಕ್ಷಿಯು ಭೂರಹಿತ ಮಹಿಳಾ ಕೃಷಿ ಕಾರ್ಮಿಕರಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಜಮೀನು ಮಾರಾಟ ಮಾಡುವ ಭೂಮಾಲೀಕರು ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟಜಾತಿ ಮತ್ತು ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಪಂಗಡಕ್ಕೆ ಸೇರಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಖರೀದಿಸುವ ಜಮೀನು ಫಲಾನುಭವಿಯು ವಾಸಿಸುತ್ತಿರುವ ಸ್ಥಳದಿಂದ ಗರಿಷ್ಠ 10 ಕಿ. ಮೀ. ವ್ಯಾಪ್ತಿಯೊಳಗೆ ಇರಬೇಕು."]', '[]', 1, '["ಫಲಾನುಭವಿಯ ಆಧಾರ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('a42a52b7-5655-4124-a602-98bbd84b0cf5', 'SOCIAL-WELFARE-DEPAR-64', '81b60538-519f-4131-bd38-c390f2d882d6', 'Ganga Kalyana', 'LoanWithSubsidy', 0, 'Under this scheme, irrigation facilities are provided to small and very small scheduled caste farmers with 1½ to 5.00 acres of land by drilling boreholes, installing pump sets, and electrifying them. In certain districts such as Kolar, Chikkaballapur, Bangalore (Rural), Bangalore (City), Tumkur, and Ramnagar, the unit cost has been increased to Rs.4.75 lakh due to declining groundwater levels. Of this amount, Rs.4.25 lakh will be subsidized, and the remaining Rs.50,000/- will be provided as a term loan.In other districts, the unit cost is fixed at Rs.3.75 lakh, with Rs.3.25 lakh provided as a subsidy and Rs.50,000/- lakh as a term loan. Additionally, out of the unit cost, Rs.75,000 per borehole will be allocated to the respective Escom for electrification, within the subsidy limit of the unit cost.', '["Applicant''s Aadhar Cards (Optional)", "Ration Card (Mandatory)", "Aadhar linked PassBook Front Page Photo (Mandatory)", "Caste & Income Certificate issued by competent authority (Optional)", "Project Report / Quotation (Optional)", "The applicant must declare they have not received prior assistance from the Corporation (Optional)", "Applicant Photo (Mandatory)", "Submission of certificate attested by The Disability Welfare Officer is required in disability cases (Optional)"]', '["Applicant should be resident of Karnataka state.", "Applicant should belong to a Scheduled Caste.", "Applicant Age should be between 21 to 56 years.", "None of the applicant''s family members should be employed in a government or semi-government position.", "The applicant or their family should not have availed any benefits or facilities from the Corporation previously.", "The applicant''s family annual income should not exceed Rs 1.5 lakh for rural areas and Rs 2.00 lakh for urban area.", "Submission of a certificate attested by the District Disability Welfare Officer is required in case of disability."]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, 'https://sevasindhuservices.karnataka.gov.in/', true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', '510cb0cd-4144-4dd8-8ce7-f874f44c1f53', 'ಗಂಗಾ ಕಲ್ಯಾಣ ಯೋಜನೆ', 'Ganga Kalyana', NULL, NULL, 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ಈ ಯೋಜನೆಯಡಿ 1½ ಎಕರೆಯಿಂದ 5.00 ಎಕರೆ ಜಮೀನು ಹೊಂದಿರುವ ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿಯ ಸಣ್ಣ ಮತ್ತು ಅತೀ ಸಣ್ಣ ರೈತರ ಜಮೀನಿನಲ್ಲಿ ಕೊಳವೆಬಾವಿ ಕೊರೆಸಿ, ಪಂಪ್ ಸೆಟ್ ಅಳವಡಿಸಿ ವಿದ್ಯುದ್ಧೀಕರಣಗೊಳಿಸಿ ನೀರಾವರಿ ಸೌಲಭ್ಯ ಕಲ್ಪಿಸಲಾಗುತ್ತಿದೆ. ಈ ಯೋಜನೆಯಡಿ ಕೋಲಾರ, ಚಿಕ್ಕಬಳ್ಳಾಪುರ, ಬೆಂಗಳೂರು(ಗ್ರಾ), ಬೆಂಗಳೂರು(ನಗರ), ತುಮಕೂರು ಮತ್ತು ರಾಮನಗರ ಜಿಲ್ಲೆಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಅಂತರ್ಜಲ ಮಟ್ಟ ಕೆಳಗೆ ಕುಸಿದಿರುವುದರಿಂದ ಈ ಜಿಲ್ಲೆಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಘಟಕ ವೆಚ್ಚ ರೂ.4.75 ಲಕ್ಷಕ್ಕೆ ಹೆಚ್ಚಿಸಲಾಗಿದ್ದು, ಇದರಲ್ಲಿ ರೂ.4.25 ಲಕ್ಷ ಸಹಾಯಧನವಿದ್ದು, ಉಳಿದ ರೂ.50,000/- ಅವಧಿಸಾಲವಾಗಿರುತ್ತದೆ. ಇತರೆ ಜಿಲ್ಲೆಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಘಟಕ ವೆಚ್ಚ ರೂ.3.75 ಲಕ್ಷ ನಿಗದಿಪಡಿಸಿದ್ದು, ಇದರಲ್ಲಿ ರೂ.3.25 ಲಕ್ಷ ಸಹಾಯಧನ ಮತ್ತು ರೂ.50,000/- ಅವಧಿಸಾಲವಾಗಿರುತ್ತದೆ. ಘಟಕ ವೆಚ್ಚದ ಪೈಕಿ ವಿದ್ಯುದ್ದೀಕರಣಕ್ಕೆ ಘಟಕ ವೆಚ್ಚದ ಸಹಾಯಧನದ ಮಿತಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಪ್ರತಿ ಕೊಳವೆಬಾವಿಗೆ ರೂ.75,000/-ಗಳನ್ನು ಸಂಬಂಧಿಸಿದ ಎಸ್ಕಾಂಗಳಿಗೆ ಬಿಡುಗಡೆ ಮಾಡಲಾಗುವುದು.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["ಕರ್ನಾಟಕ ರಾಜ್ಯದ ನಿವಾಸಿಯಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿ ಸಮುದಾಯಕ್ಕೆ ಸೇರಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ವಯಸ್ಸು 21 ರಿಂದ 56 ವರ್ಷದೊಳಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸದಸ್ಯರು, ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ/ಅರೆ ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ ಸಂಸ್ಥೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಉದ್ಯೋಗಿಯಾಗಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಅಥವಾ ಅವರ ಕುಟುಂಬದವರು ಈ ಹಿಂದೆ ನಿಗಮದಿಂದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸೌಲಭ್ಯ ಪಡೆದಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ವಾರ್ಷಿಕ ಆದಾಯ ಗ್ರಾಮೀಣ ಭಾಗಕ್ಕೆ ರೂ 1.5 ಲಕ್ಷ ಹಾಗೂ ನಗರ ಪ್ರದೇಶದಲ್ಲಿರುವವರಿಗೆ ರೂ 2.00 ಲಕ್ಷ ಮೀರಿರಬಾರದು.", "ವಿಕಲಚೇತನರಾಗಿದ್ದಲ್ಲಿ ಜಿಲ್ಲಾ ಅಂಗವಿಕಲ ಕಲ್ಯಾಣಾಧಿಕಾರಿಗಳಿಂದ ದೃಢೀಕರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟ ಪ್ರಮಾಣ ಪತ್ರ ಸಲ್ಲಿಸುವುದು."]', '[]', 1, '["ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಆಧಾರ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('ca83f4b2-1e1a-46ee-8b95-41672a0a0a34', 'SOCIAL-WELFARE-DEPAR-63', '81b60538-519f-4131-bd38-c390f2d882d6', 'Establishment of Charma shilpa Mechanized Production Unit', 'LoanWithSubsidy', 0, 'In 2022-23, a scheme will be implemented to promote self-employment and increase self-confidence among Scheduled Castes and Scheduled Tribes youth. This scheme is designed to facilitate e-commerce businesses and create employment in other services. Under this scheme, beneficiaries who purchase electric or other two-wheeler/three-wheeler goods transport vehicles will receive a subsidy of Rs. 50,000 and a loan of Rs. 20,000.', '["Applicant Aadhar Cards (Mandatory)", "Applicant Ration Card (Mandatory)", "Applicant Voter ID (Mandatory)", "Caste & Income Certificate issued by competent authority (Mandatory)", "Project Report / Quotation (Mandatory)", "The applicant must declare they have not received prior assistance from the Corporation (Mandatory)", "Applicant Aadhar Card (Mandatory)", "Submission of certificate attested by The Disability Welfare Officer is required in disability cases (Optional)"]', '["Applicant should be resident of Karnataka state.", "Applicant should belong to a Scheduled Caste.", "Applicant Age should be between 21 to 56 years.", "None of the applicant''s family members should be employed in a government or semi-government position.", "The applicant or their family should not have availed any benefits or facilities from the Corporation previously.", "The applicant''s family annual income should not exceed Rs 1.5 lakh for rural areas and Rs 2.00 lakh for urban area.", "Submission of a certificate attested by the District Disability Welfare Officer is required in case of disability."]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, 'https://sevasindhuservices.karnataka.gov.in/', true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', '510cb0cd-4144-4dd8-8ce7-f874f44c1f53', 'ಚರ್ಮಶಿಲ್ಪ ಯಾಂತ್ರೀಕೃತ ಉತ್ಪಾದನಾ ಘಟಕದ ಸ್ಥಾಪನೆ', 'Establishment of Charma shilpa Mechanized Production Unit', NULL, NULL, 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2022-23 ನೇ ಸಾಲಿನಲ್ಲಿ ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿ ಮತ್ತು ವರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಪಂಗಡದ ಯುವಕರಲ್ಲಿ ಸ್ವಯಂ ಉದ್ಯೋಗವನ್ನು ಉತ್ತೇಜಿಸಲು ಮತ್ತು ಆತ್ಮವಿಶ್ವಾಸವನ್ನು ಹೆಚ್ಚಿಸಲು , ಇ-ಕಾಮರ್ಸ್ ವ್ಯವಹಾರಗಳನ್ನು ಸುಲಭಗೊಳಿಸಲು ಮತ್ತು ಇತರ ಸೇವೆಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಉದ್ಯೋಗವನ್ನು ಸೃಷ್ಟಿಸಲು ಈ ಯೋಜನೆಯನ್ನು ವಿನ್ಯಾಸಗೊಳಿಸಲಾಗಿದೆ. ಈ ಯೋಜನೆಯಡಿಯಲ್ಲಿ, ವಿದ್ಯುತ್ ಅಥವಾ ಇತರೆ ಎರಡು/ಮೂರು ಚಕ್ರದ ಸರಕು ಸಾಗಣೆ ವಾಹನಗಳನ್ನು ಖರೀದಿಸುವ ಫಲಾನುಭವಿಗಳಿಗೆ ರೂ. 50,000 ಸಹಾಯಧನ ಹಾಗೂ ರೂ. 20,000 ಸಾಲವನ್ನು ನೀಡಲಾಗುತ್ತದೆ.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["ಕರ್ನಾಟಕ ರಾಜ್ಯದ ನಿವಾಸಿಯಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿ ಸಮುದಾಯಕ್ಕೆ ಸೇರಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ವಯಸ್ಸು 21 ರಿಂದ 56 ವರ್ಷದೊಳಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸದಸ್ಯರು, ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ/ಅರೆ ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ ಸಂಸ್ಥೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಉದ್ಯೋಗಿಯಾಗಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಅಥವಾ ಅವರ ಕುಟುಂಬದವರು ಈ ಹಿಂದೆ ನಿಗಮದಿಂದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸೌಲಭ್ಯ ಪಡೆದಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ವಾರ್ಷಿಕ ಆದಾಯ ಗ್ರಾಮೀಣ ಭಾಗಕ್ಕೆ ರೂ 1.5 ಲಕ್ಷ ಹಾಗೂ ನಗರ ಪ್ರದೇಶದಲ್ಲಿರುವವರಿಗೆ ರೂ 2.00 ಲಕ್ಷ ಮೀರಿರಬಾರದು.", "ವಿಕಲಚೇತನರಾಗಿದ್ದಲ್ಲಿ ಜಿಲ್ಲಾ ಅಂಗವಿಕಲ ಕಲ್ಯಾಣಾಧಿಕಾರಿಗಳಿಂದ ದೃಢೀಕರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟ ಪ್ರಮಾಣ ಪತ್ರ ಸಲ್ಲಿಸುವುದು."]', '[]', 1, '["ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಆಧಾರ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('3e4d17fc-a681-4d27-b461-3fea5e7b8f66', 'SOCIAL-WELFARE-DEPAR-62', '81b60538-519f-4131-bd38-c390f2d882d6', 'Charmakara Housing Scheme', 'Subsidy', 0, 'Charmakara Housing Scheme', '["Applicant Aadhar Cards (Optional)", "Ration Card (Mandatory)", "Aadhar linked PassBook Front Page Photo (Mandatory)", "Caste & Income Certificate issued by competent authority (Optional)", "The applicant must declare they have not received prior assistance from the Corporation (Optional)", "Passport size photo of the applicant (Mandatory)", "Small and Marginal Farmer Certificate (Mandatory)", "RTC (Mandatory)", "Submission of certificate attested by The Disability Welfare Officer is required in disability cases (Optional)"]', '["Applicant should be resident of Karnataka state.", "Applicant should belong to a Scheduled Caste.", "Applicants must be at least 21 years old and there is no upper age limit.", "None of the applicant''s family members should be employed in a government or semi-government position.", "The applicant or their family should not have availed any benefits or facilities from the Corporation previously.", "The applicant''s family annual income should not exceed Rs 1.5 lakh for rural areas and Rs 2.00 lakh for urban area.", "Submission of a certificate attested by the District Disability Welfare Officer is required in case of disability.", "The applicants must be small and medium marginal farmers and should not have access to irrigation facilities."]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, 'https://sevasindhuservices.karnataka.gov.in/', true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', '510cb0cd-4144-4dd8-8ce7-f874f44c1f53', 'ಡಾ. ಬಾಬು ಜಗಜೀವನ್ ರಾಮ್ ಚರ್ಮಕಾರರ ವಸತಿ ಯೋಜನೆ', 'Charmakara Housing Scheme', NULL, NULL, 'Online', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ಡಾ. ಬಾಬು ಜಗಜೀವನ್ ರಾಮ್ ಚರ್ಮಕಾರರ ವಸತಿ ಯೋಜನೆ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["ಕರ್ನಾಟಕ ರಾಜ್ಯದ ನಿವಾಸಿಯಾಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿ ಸಮುದಾಯಕ್ಕೆ ಸೇರಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರು ಕನಿಷ್ಠ 21 ವರ್ಷಗಳು ಪೂರ್ಣಗೊಂಡಿರಬೇಕು ಗರಿಷ್ಠ ವಯೋಮಿತಿ ತೆಗೆದು ಹಾಕಲಾಗಿದೆ.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸದಸ್ಯರು, ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ/ಅರೆ ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ ಸಂಸ್ಥೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಉದ್ಯೋಗಿಯಾಗಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಅಥವಾ ಅವರ ಕುಟುಂಬದವರು ಈ ಹಿಂದೆ ನಿಗಮದಿಂದ ಯಾವುದೇ ಸೌಲಭ್ಯ ಪಡೆದಿರಬಾರದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ವಾರ್ಷಿಕ ಆದಾಯ ಗ್ರಾಮೀಣ ಭಾಗಕ್ಕೆ ರೂ 1.5 ಲಕ್ಷ ಹಾಗೂ ನಗರ ಪ್ರದೇಶದಲ್ಲಿರುವವರಿಗೆ ರೂ 2.00 ಲಕ್ಷ ಮೀರಿರಬಾರದು.", "ವಿಕಲಚೇತನರಾಗಿದ್ದಲ್ಲಿ ಜಿಲ್ಲಾ ಅಂಗವಿಕಲ ಕಲ್ಯಾಣಾಧಿಕಾರಿಗಳಿಂದ ದೃಢೀಕರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟ ಪ್ರಮಾಣ ಪತ್ರ ಸಲ್ಲಿಸುವುದು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರು ಸಣ್ಣ ಮತ್ತು ಅತಿ ಸಣ್ಣ ರೈತರಾಗಿರಬೇಕು ಹಾಗೂ ನೀರಾವರಿ ಸೌಲಭ್ಯ ಹೊಂದಿರಬಾರದು."]', '[]', 1, '["ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಆಧಾರ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
