ಲ್ಲಾ ಪಂಚಾಯತ್"]', 1, '["ಜಾತಿ ಮತ್ತು ಆದಾಯ ಪ್ರಮಾಣಪತ್ರ, ಆಧಾರ್ ಕಾರ್ಡ್, ಪಡಿತರ ಚೀಟಿ, ಶುಲ್ಕದ ವಿವರ, ಪಿಯುಸಿ (PUC) ಅಂಕಪಟ್ಟಿ, ಸಿಇಟಿ (CET)/ನೀಟ್ (NEET) ಆದೇಶದ ಪ್ರತಿ, ವ್ಯಾಸಂಗ ಪ್ರಮಾಣಪತ್ರ (12ನೇ ತರಗತಿ ಅಥವಾ ಪಿಯುಸಿ), ಆಧಾರ್ ಜೋಡಣೆಯಾಗಿರುವ ಬ್ಯಾಂಕ್ ಪಾಸ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('36a5cf4f-0786-4983-ac4e-34dbf30b1358', 'BACKWARD-CLASSES-WEL-49', '59d7c155-e129-436a-b747-c5cb6abba051', 'Loan Scheme for Higher Education in Foreign Universities:', 'Education loan', 0, '', '["Pasport Size Photo", "Study Certificate", "Passport", "Visa", "Fee Structure", "aadhaar card,ration card, caste and income certificate", "Collateral Letter", "Parent Approval Letter", "Admission Confirmation Intimation Letter Provided by the Foreign University", "document_icon", "Aadhar linked PassBook Front Page Photo"]', '["The annual income limit for the student''s family is Rs. 15.00 lakhs. Regarding the age limit, a maximum age of 32 years has been fixed for postgraduates and 35 years for Ph.D. holders. As collateral security for the loan, immovable property owned by the student''s father or a guarantor must be pledged to the Corporation. The student must have passed the qualifying examination in the First Class."]', '[]', '["Beneficiaries were selected through a selection committee chaired by the Managing Director"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', '90bac16e-67e0-4fc8-8fc4-1b70354c107c', 'ವಿದೇಶಿ ವಿಶ್ವವಿದ್ಯಾಲಯಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಉನ್ನತ ಶಿಕ್ಷಣ ವ್ಯಾಸಂಗಕ್ಕೆ ಸಾಲ', 'To provide loan facility up to Rs.25.00 lakhs per annum maximum of Rs.50.00 lakhs for a period of 2 years without interest to the students of Kadugolla community who are admitted to Master Degree, PhD, Post-Doctoral courses for higher education in foreign universities With QS World Ranking below 1000.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 30.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, 'No', '["ವಿದ್ಯಾರ್ಥಿಯಕುಟುಂಬದವಾರ್ಷಿಕಆದಾಯಮಿತಿ ರೂ.15.00 ಲಕ್ಷಗಳು.ವಯೋಮಿತಿ:ವಿದ್ಯಾರ್ಥಿಯವಯಸ್ಸು 32 (ಸ್ನಾತಕೋತ್ತರಪದವೀಧರರಿಗೆ) ಮತ್ತುಪಿ.ಎಚ್.ಡಿ. ಪದವೀಧವಿದರರಿಗೆ 35 ವರ್ಷಗಳವಯೋಮಿತಿಯನ್ನುನಿಗಧಿಪಡಿಸಲಾಗಿದೆ. ಸಾಲದಭದ್ರತೆಗೆವಿದ್ಯಾರ್ಥಿಯತಂದೆಅಥವಾಜಾಮೀನುದಾರರುಹೊಂದಿರುವಸ್ಥಿರಾಸ್ತಿಯನ್ನುನಿಗಮಕ್ಕೆಆಧಾರದಮಾಡಬೇಕು (ಕೊಲ್ಯಾಟರಲ್‌ ಸೆಕ್ಯೂರಿಟಿ)ಅರ್ಹತಾಪರೀಕ್ಷೆಯಲ್ಲಿಪ್ರಥಮದರ್ಜೆಯಲ್ಲಿಉತ್ತೀರ್ಣರಾಗಿರಬೇಕು."]', '["ವ್ಯವಸ್ಥಾಪಕ ನಿರ್ದೇಶಕರ ಅಧ್ಯಕ್ಷತೆಯ ಆಯ್ಕೆ ಸಮಿತಿಯ ಮೂಲಕ ಫಲಾನುಭವಿಗಳನ್ನು ಆಯ್ಕೆ ಮಾಡಲಾಯಿತು."]', 1, '["ಪಾಸ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('6062804b-de56-4be4-90a9-2e64ef4523cb', 'BACKWARD-CLASSES-WEL-48', '59d7c155-e129-436a-b747-c5cb6abba051', 'Ganga Kalyana Scheme', 'Irrigational purpose to help farmers', 0, '', '["Ration card,aadhaar card,Small and Marginal Farmer Certificate,RTC,Passport size photo of the applicant"]', '["The annual family income of the applicant must be within Rs. 98,000 for rural areas and Rs. 1,20,000 for urban areas.No age limit"]', '[]', '["Beneficiaries will be selected through a selection committee chaired by the Chief Executive Officer of the Zilla Panchayat."]', NULL, NULL, NULL, true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', '90bac16e-67e0-4fc8-8fc4-1b70354c107c', 'ಗಂಗಾ ಕಲ್ಯಾಣ ಯೋಜನೆ', 'Irrigation facilities will be provided to the small and very small farmers lands belonging to the Kadugolla community and whose annual income is below the limit of Rs.98,000/-.Bangalore North, Bangalore South, Bangalore Rural, Kolar, Chikkaballapur, Tumkur and Ramnagar unit cost Rs.4.75 lakhs for individual tube well project Rs.4.25 lakhs subsidy out of which Rs.75,000/- will be paid to ESCOM’s for electrification. In case the unit cannot be completed, a loan of Rs.50,000/- will be sanctioned at an interest rate of 4%.For the remaining districts, the unit cost is Rs.3.75 lakh in which subsidy is Rs.3.25 lakh and loan of Rs.50,000/- will be sanctioned at 4% interest rate. Out of the subsidy amount, Rs.75,000/- per tube well will be paid to the ESCOM’s for electrification.
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('fabe97aa-f4f9-4cb1-90c4-11a65e473914', 'BACKWARD-CLASSES-WEL-47', '59d7c155-e129-436a-b747-c5cb6abba051', 'Swavalambi Sarathi Scheme', 'self employment through taxi /goods vehicle', 0, '', '["Passport Size Photo of the applicant", "Driving Licence", "Vehicle Quotation", "Aadhar linked PassBook Front Page Photo,Ration card,aadhaar card"]', '["The applicant must be between 18 and 45 years of age.", "The annual family income of the applicant must be within Rs. 98,000 for rural areas and Rs. 1,20,000 for urban areas."]', '[]', '["Beneficiaries will be selected through a selection committee chaired by the Chief Executive Officer of the Zilla Panchayat."]', NULL, NULL, NULL, true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', '90bac16e-67e0-4fc8-8fc4-1b70354c107c', 'ಸ್ವಾವಲಂಬಿ ಸಾರಥಿ ಯೋಜನೆಗೆ ಅರ್ಜಿ', 'Members of the Kadugolla community in both urban and rural areas will be encouraged to take up self-employment through the provision of a subsidy—covering 50% of the cost up to a maximum of ₹3.00 lakh—for the purchase of four-wheeled vehicles. Under the ''Swavalambi Sarathi'' scheme, this assistance will be extended to unemployed youths from the Uppara community who hold a valid driving license and have secured bank loans to purchase such vehicles.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 30.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, 'No', '["ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರವಯಸ್ಸು18 ರಿಂದ 45 ವರ್ಷದ ಒಳಗಿರಬೇಕು.", "ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಕುಟುಂಬ ವಾರ್ಷಿಕವರಮಾನ ಗ್ರಾಮಾಂತರ ಪ್ರದೇಶದವರಿಗೆರೂ.98,000/- ಹಾಗೂ ಪಟ್ಟಣಪ್ರದೇಶದವರಿಗೆರೂ.1,20,000/- ಒಳಗಿರಬೇಕು."]', '["ಜಿಲ್ಲಾ ಪಂಚಾಯತ್"]', 1, '["ಅರ್ಜಿದಾರರ ಪಾಸ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('6ebe2c30-61ba-48e9-9a10-75a3e4236f9b', 'REVENUE-DEPARTMENT-99', '18b9c82c-f365-482c-acdb-00aa3d65b1c6', 'B-side Hissa Theeni Book', 'General', 0, 'ISSUE OF DUPLICATE COPIES IN SURVEY SECTION (REVISION DURASTI PRATHI BOOK)', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, 'https://sevasindhu.karnataka.gov.in/', true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', '4a83508d-1e48-4c5d-a4a9-bf202811c23b', 'B side ಹಿಸ್ಸಾ ತೀನಿ ಪುಸ್ತಕ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 35.00, NULL, 'B side ಹಿಸ್ಸಾ ತೀನಿ ಪುಸ್ತಕ ನಕಲು ಪ್ರತಿಯ ವಿತರಣೆ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '[]', 1, '[]', NULL, NULL, '3106');
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('72e985a8-739f-41a2-a3d7-1b8dea6ac7cd', 'BACKWARD-CLASSES-WEL-45', '59d7c155-e129-436a-b747-c5cb6abba051', 'Arivu Educational Loan Scheme(renewal)', 'Education loan', 0, '', '["Caste and income certificate,Aadhaar card,Ration card,Fees structure, PUC Marks Card,CET /NEET order copy,Study Certificate(12th or PUC),Aadhar linked PassBook Front Page Photo,Admission Letter"]', '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', '90bac16e-67e0-4fc8-8fc4-1b70354c107c', 'ಅರಿವು ಶೈಕ್ಷಣಿಕ ಸಾಲ ಯೋಜನೆ (ನವೀಕರಣ)', 'In this scheme the selected beneficiaries in arivu fresh scheme have to apply for renewal for next academic year''s installment', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '[]', 1, '["ಜಾತಿ ಮತ್ತು ಆದಾಯ ಪ್ರಮಾಣಪತ್ರ, ಆಧಾರ್ ಕಾರ್ಡ್, ಪಡಿತರ ಚೀಟಿ, ಶುಲ್ಕದ ವಿವರ, ಪಿಯುಸಿ (PUC) ಅಂಕಪಟ್ಟಿ, ಸಿಇಟಿ (CET)/ನೀಟ್ (NEET) ಆದೇಶದ ಪ್ರತಿ, ವ್ಯಾಸಂಗ ಪ್ರಮಾಣಪತ್ರ (12ನೇ ತರಗತಿ ಅಥವಾ ಪಿಯುಸಿ), ಆಧಾರ್ ಜೋಡಣೆಯಾಗಿರುವ ಬ್ಯಾಂಕ್ ಪಾಸ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO discovery.sevaone_service_master (id, service_id, department_id, service_name, category, sakala_days, description, required_documents_json, eligibility_json, aliases_json, steps_json, portal, service_url, deeplink_citizen_url, is_active, created_at, sub_department_id, service_name_kannada, short_description, department_service_id, jurisdiction, mode_of_service, remarks, department_fee, service_charge, description_kannada, short_description_kannada, deeplink_operator_url, homepage_url, is_sakala_enabled, sakala_label_raw, eligibility_json_kannada, steps_json_kannada, version, documents_json_kannada, deeplink_citizen_url_kannada, integration_method, sevasindhu_service_id) VALUES ('ed87ab86-7969-43ed-9a14-8283014ca7ad', 'BACKWARD-CLASSES-WEL-44', '59d7c155-e129-436a-b747-c5cb6abba051', 'Arivu Educational Loan Scheme (Fresh)', 'Education loan', 0, '', '["Caste and income certificate,Aadhaar card,Ration card,Fees structure, PUC Marks Card,CET /NEET order copy,Study Certificate(12th or PUC),Aadhar linked PassBook Front Page Photo,Admission Letter"]', '["The annual income of the candidate and their family must be within the limit of ₹3.50 lakh.Age limit is 15-30 years"]', '[]', '["Beneficiaries will be selected through a selection committee chaired by the Chief Executive Officer of the Zilla Panchayat."]', NULL, NULL, NULL, true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', '90bac16e-67e0-4fc8-8fc4-1b70354c107c', 'ಅರಿವು ಶೈ ಕ್ಷಣಿಕ ಸಾಲ ಯೋಜನೆ (ಹೊಸ)', 'Under this scheme, an educational loan of up to ₹1,00,000—at an annual interest rate of 2%—will be sanctioned to students from the Kadugolla community who have secured admission to professional higher education courses (such as engineering, medicine, and dentistry) through CET or NEET. The annual income of the candidate and their family must be within the limit of ₹3.50 lakh.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 30.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, 'No', '["ಅಭ್ಯರ್ಥಿ ಮತ್ತು ಅವರ ಕುಟುಂಬದ ವಾರ್ಷಿಕ ಆದಾಯವು ₹3.50 ಲಕ್ಷದ ಮಿತಿಯೊಳಗೆ ಇರಬೇಕು. ವಯಸ್ಸಿನ ಮಿತಿ 15 ರಿಂದ 30 ವರ್ಷಗಳು."]', '["ಜಿಲ್ಲಾ ಪಂಚಾಯತ್"]', 1, '["ಜಾತಿ ಮತ್ತು ಆದಾಯ ಪ್ರಮಾಣಪತ್ರ, ಆಧಾರ್ ಕಾರ್ಡ್, ಪಡಿತರ ಚೀಟಿ, ಶುಲ್ಕದ ವಿವರ, ಪಿಯುಸಿ (PUC) ಅಂಕಪಟ್ಟಿ, ಸಿಇಟಿ (CET)/ನೀಟ್ (NEET) ಆದೇಶದ ಪ್ರತಿ, ವ್ಯಾಸಂಗ ಪ್ರಮಾಣಪತ್ರ (12ನೇ ತರಗತಿ ಅಥವಾ ಪಿಯುಸಿ), ಆಧಾರ್ ಜೋಡಣೆಯಾಗಿರುವ ಬ್ಯಾಂಕ್ ಪಾಸ್"]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
