O BE ENCLOSED IF THE APPLICANT OBTAINED BUSINESS PREMISES ON RENTAL BASIS IN THE MARKET YARD."]', '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, true, '2026-10-30 16:55:56.458552+00', NULL, 'ಜಿನ್ನರ್ ಪರವಾನಗಿ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '[]', 1, '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL);
